		{ f="1744-ddd22a35", h="ddd22a35", t="That's Rupert Boch you're looking for.  He and his entourage have a room upstairs at the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast end of Brill.", d=10.360, v="scourge-male-warrior" },
		{ f="1744-e7cb64ec", h="e7cb64ec", t="There's a Bat Handler inside the Undercity.  Head south down the road out of Brill, then west at the T-intersection.  The Ruins of Lordaeron will be on your left.  Go into them and then down into the Undercity.  You can ask an Undercity Guardian there for further assistance.", d=18.040, v="scourge-male-warrior" },
		{ f="1744-ef767f20", h="ef767f20", t="Which profession?", d=1.480, v="scourge-male-warrior" },
		{ f="1744-effe3a80", h="effe3a80", t="What could you possibly need a bank for?  Very well, you'll need to go through the Ruins of Lordaeron to the south of Brill.  In the back are a set of elevators leading down into the Undercity.  When you get there stop any of those lumbering Abominations they like to call an Undercity Guardian and ask it for better directions.", d=23.870, v="scourge-male-warrior" },
		{ f="1744-f7d8157b", h="f7d8157b", t="Marion Call is keeping Dark Cleric Beryl company in the reading room upstairs at the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast edge of Brill.  I'm just dying to see who wins that staring contest.", d=15.320, v="scourge-male-warrior" },
	},
