		{ f="2210-4828fa32", h="4828fa32", t="Nothing quite like the feel of something dead rubbing up against you.  You can find Shelene Rhobart by heading southeast on the road out of town, and then going east at the intersection.  She's at a small camp there not too far along the road.", d=16.760, v="scourge-female-warrior" },
