		{ f="2210-52502812", h="52502812", t="Rand Rhobart is fairly good at skinning felbats and the like.  You can find him at a camp along the road to the southeast of Brill.  Take the road southeast out of town and then head east at the intersection.", d=12.800, v="scourge-female-warrior" },
