		{ f="3222-93a5a897", h="93a5a897", t="We have no such place in the village.  The soaring heights of Thunder Bluff does though.  Head north up the road out of Bloodhoof Village until you come to the base of the bluffs.  There ride the elevator to the top and speak with a Bluffwatcher.  May your ancestors watch over you.", d=16.528, v="tauren-male-warrior" },
		{ f="3222-949098ae", h="949098ae", t="You will find Pyall Silentstride inside the great tent in the northwest corner of the village.  He can teach you what you crave.", d=7.688, v="tauren-male-warrior" },
		{ f="3222-96637971", h="96637971", t="Bandages, anti-venoms and such things, these are the inevitable necessities of life on the plains.  Vira Younghoof can teach you this knowledge.  You can find her in the long house on the west side of Bloodhoof Village.", d=13.219, v="tauren-male-warrior" },
		{ f="3222-9bb88714", h="9bb88714", t="There is a wise one in the village who goes by the name Narm Skychaser.  He can continue your learning along the path of the Shaman.", d=8.916, v="tauren-male-warrior" },
		{ f="3222-9cc7dc11", h="9cc7dc11", t="Krang Stonehoof stands astride his training circle at the southeast corner of the village.", d=4.945, v="tauren-male-warrior" },
		{ f="3222-a90f1325", h="a90f1325", t="Yaw Sharpmane awaits you on the north edge of the village.  He can teach you the ways of the Hunter.", d=5.876, v="tauren-male-warrior" },
		{ f="3222-abc229e8", h="abc229e8", t="Vira Younghoof keeps her practice inside the long house on the west side of the village.", d=5.678, v="tauren-male-warrior" },
		{ f="3222-ae1075fe", h="ae1075fe", t="To learn to be one with Nature in the eyes of the Earth Mother, this is a matter of pride.  If your will is to learn the ways of the Hunter you must seek out Yaw Sharpmane at the north end of Bloodhoof Village.", d=12.846, v="tauren-male-warrior" },
		{ f="3222-b02bf9f3", h="b02bf9f3", t="Hmmm, I think you will need to go up to Thunder Bluff to learn that.  Head north on the road out of Bloodhoof Village.  It will take you to the base of Thunder Bluff.  Ride the elevator to the top and you should be able to ask any of the Bluffwatchers there for further assistance.", d=14.751, v="tauren-male-warrior" },
		{ f="3222-b2702c54", h="b2702c54", t="Ah yes, Skinning.  There is no one finer in wielding a skinning knife than Yonn Deepcut.  You can find him in the great tent at the northwest corner of the village.", d=10.138, v="tauren-male-warrior" },
		{ f="3222-b41a2ca2", h="b41a2ca2", t="You are looking for Uthan Stillwater.  You will find him west of the village, fishing at Stonebull Lake.", d=6.921, v="tauren-male-warrior" },
		{ f="3222-b9129861", h="b9129861", t="Nothing frees the spirit like soaring through the sky.  There is such a place in our great tribal center Thunder Bluff.  The road north out of Bloodhoof Village will guide you there.  Once you ride the elevator to the top speak with one of the Bluffwatchers who can give you further directions.", d=16.905, v="tauren-male-warrior" },
		{ f="3222-bc214aac", h="bc214aac", t="The way of the Druid is sibling to the Shaman.  Gennia Runetotem is steeped in such knowledge.  Seek her out in the large tent on the east side of Bloodhoof Village.", d=11.205, v="tauren-male-warrior" },
		{ f="3222-bd96d45c", h="bd96d45c", t="Tailoring you say?  Hmmm.  Ah yes, of course.  You'll need to head to Thunder Bluff, up north.  Take the path out of the village to get there.  When you arrive at the base of the bluffs ride the elevator to the top of the rise and speak with one of the Bluffwatchers.", d=14.156, v="tauren-male-warrior" },
		{ f="3222-e1825851", h="e1825851", t="There are those that would teach you of Herbalism in the great home of Thunder Bluff away to the north.  Follow the road out of the village to get there and at the base of the bluff ride the elevator to the top of the rise.  There are many Bluffwatchers there who can direct you further.", d=14.996, v="tauren-male-warrior" },
		{ f="3222-e4073a2b", h="e4073a2b", t="Innkeeper Kauth can see to your needs.  He can be found on the west side of the village in one of the long houses.", d=6.132, v="tauren-male-warrior" },
		{ f="3222-ebd9d5d2", h="ebd9d5d2", t="It is Gennia Runetotem's counsel that you seek.  You will find her in the large tent on the east side of the village.", d=7.274, v="tauren-male-warrior" },
		{ f="3222-ef767f20", h="ef767f20", t="Which profession?", d=1.293, v="tauren-male-warrior" },
		{ f="3222-fac317f1", h="fac317f1", t="Using the fruits of the Earth Mother to create potions to aid us in our eternal struggle is an honorable endeavor.  To learn of this you must travel north to our great home of Thunder Bluff.  When you arrive at the top seek out the assistance of one of the Bluffwatchers for more specific directions.", d=15.549, v="tauren-male-warrior" },
	},
	[3223] = {
		{ f="3223-04b7ed5d", h="04b7ed5d", t="You desire to shape the bones of the Earth Mother into tools that will aid the Horde.  Good, good.  Follow the path north out of Bloodhoof Village until you come to the elevator leading to the top of Thunder Bluff.  A Bluffwatcher there can give you further assistance.", d=20.224, v="tauren-female-official" },
		{ f="3223-07913c1a", h="07913c1a", t="If you desire to learn the ways of Herbalism then it is to Thunder Bluff that you must go.  Follow the road north out of Bloodhoof Village and take the elevator to the top of the rise.  You can ask a Bluffwatcher there for further assistance.", d=15.820, v="tauren-female-official" },
		{ f="3223-12ef1a85", h="12ef1a85", t="There is a Blacksmithing Trainer in our great home Thunder Bluff to the north.  If you seek such knowledge then head there and ask one of the Bluffwatchers for directions.", d=10.800, v="tauren-female-official" },
		{ f="3223-18180d43", h="18180d43", t="If it is the way of the Warrior that you crave then you must seek out Krang Stonehoof.  You will find him in the southeast corner of the village at his training circle, often instructing his other students.", d=13.105, v="tauren-female-official" },
		{ f="3223-19de8335", h="19de8335", t="Yonn Deepcut can be found inside the great tent at the northwest corner of Bloodhoof Village.", d=5.994, v="tauren-female-official" },
		{ f="3223-23576320", h="23576320", t="Give a bull a fish and feed him for a day.  Teach a bull to fish and feed him for life.  Uthan Stillwater can teach you how to fish.  Seek his wisdom west of Bloodhoof Village along the banks of Stonebull Lake.", d=13.209, v="tauren-female-official" },
		{ f="3223-2d420e50", h="2d420e50", t="I hear that they have a Mining Trainer in Thunder Bluff to the north.  Take the road out of the village and when you get there ride the elevator to the top of the rise.  Any of the Bluffwatchers should be able to help you from there.", d=11.998, v="tauren-female-official" },
		{ f="3223-3fcee8ad", h="3fcee8ad", t="Inside the great tent at the northwest corner of the village is where Chaw Stronghide resides.  He will teach you what you must know of Leatherworking for now.", d=14.001, v="tauren-female-official" },
		{ f="3223-44f40d5a", h="44f40d5a", t="When we use the hides of the animals we must fell for food or protection we give honor to the Earth Mother and respect to the animal.  Chaw Stronghide can teach you of such things.  You will find him in the great tent at the northwest corner of Bloodhoof Village.", d=16.305, v="tauren-female-official" },
		{ f="3223-482a241f", h="482a241f", t="There is a large tent on the east side of Bloodhoof Village.  You will find Narm Skychaser awaiting you there.", d=7.563, v="tauren-female-official" },
		{ f="3223-4dab2020", h="4dab2020", t="While we have no Alchemy Trainer here in Bloodhoof Village, there is one in Thunder Bluff to the north.  Follow the road there and ask one of the Bluffwatchers for directions when you get to the top.", d=11.831, v="tauren-female-official" },
		{ f="3223-4fe188ab", h="4fe188ab", t="Such wisdom is steeped in a mystery that can only be found in great Thunder Bluff.  Follow the path north out of Bloodhoof Village until you come to an elevator at the base of the bluffs.  Ride it to the top and ask one of the Bluffwatchers for further assistance.", d=14.805, v="tauren-female-official" },
		{ f="3223-501e2aab", h="501e2aab", t="Ah yes, it is Seikwa that you must find.  I believe I saw her last standing out in front of the inn.", d=7.498, v="tauren-female-official" },
		{ f="3223-5206b4c5", h="5206b4c5", t="Which trainer do you seek?", d=2.479, v="tauren-female-official" },
		{ f="3223-5339f23b", h="5339f23b", t="Away to Thunder Bluff to the north is where your journey takes you then friend.  Once there seek out the wisdom of one of the Bluffwatchers who can tell you directly where to find whom you seek.", d=12.940, v="tauren-female-official" },
		{ f="3223-58d6dae5", h="58d6dae5", t="Ah, you must go to the great heights of Thunder Bluff to visit one of those.  Follow the path north out of Bloodhoof Village.  At the base of the bluffs is an elevator that will take you to the top.  When you get there ask for further directions from one of the Bluffwatchers.", d=15.982, v="tauren-female-official" },
		{ f="3223-5d6f0b28", h="5d6f0b28", t="What are you looking for?", d=2.372, v="tauren-female-official" },
		{ f="3223-64145ef5", h="64145ef5", t="My mouth waters just to think on it.  Pyall Silentstride is the finest cook in Bloodhoof Village.  You will find him in the great tent at the northwest corner of the village.", d=11.477, v="tauren-female-official" },
		{ f="3223-7803dda6", h="7803dda6", t="Seikwa can take care of your animal friends when you have the need.  Seek her out in front of the inn.", d=8.140, v="tauren-female-official" },
		{ f="3223-7bb4f742", h="7bb4f742", t="There is a time and a place for all things, including relaxation.  On the west side of Bloodhoof Village Innkeeper Kauth maintains a long house for those who seek to rest.  You will find him there.", d=15.273, v="tauren-female-official" },
		{ f="3223-7c3e2189", h="7c3e2189", t="Unfortunately we do not have one who teaches Tailoring here in Bloodhoof Village, but you can find a trainer in Thunder Bluff.  Follow the path north out of the village until you come to a set of elevators.  Take one up to the top of the rise and ask one of the Bluffwatchers there for directions.", d=17.066, v="tauren-female-official" },
