		{ f="3223-b02bf9f3", h="b02bf9f3", t="Hmmm, I think you will need to go up to Thunder Bluff to learn that.  Head north on the road out of Bloodhoof Village.  It will take you to the base of Thunder Bluff.  Ride the elevator to the top and you should be able to ask any of the Bluffwatchers there for further assistance.", d=14.331, v="tauren-female-official" },
