		{ f="6930-4a0923b3", h="4a0923b3", t="Are you interested in exploring one of these dungeons?", d=4.703, v="orc-male-standard" },
		{ f="6930-4a6950fb", h="4a6950fb", t="The ruins of Dire Maul stand in central Ferelas.", d=4.550, v="orc-male-standard" },
		{ f="6930-4f48ef1f", h="4f48ef1f", t="Situated along the Zoram Strand of Ashenvale, Blackfathom Deeps was once a glorious temple dedicated to the night elves' moon-goddess Elune. However, the great Sundering shattered the temple - sinking it beneath the waves of the Veiled Sea. There it remained untouched - until, drawn by its ancient power - the naga and satyr emerged to plumb its secrets. Legends hold that the ancient beast, Aku'mai, has taken up residence within the temple's ruins.  ", d=35.229, v="orc-male-standard" },
