		{ f="9501-ab572ddf", h="ab572ddf", t="The monastery was once a center for learning and enlightenment. With the rise of the undead Scourge during the Third War, the peaceful Monastery was converted into a stronghold of the fanatical Scarlet Crusade. The Crusaders are intolerant of all non-human races, regardless of alliance or affiliation. They believe that any and all outsiders are potential carriers of the undead plague - and must be destroyed.  ", d=37.310, v="tauren-male-elder" },
		{ f="9501-ad5ec0ca", h="ad5ec0ca", t="No, I'm not, but lots of others are looking for love.  You should buy my love tokens, put on some cologne or perfume, and then pass them around!", d=14.800, v="tauren-male-elder" },
		{ f="9501-adc7501c", h="adc7501c", t="The School for Necromancy known as Scholomance is on the ruined island of Caer Darrow in the Western Plaguelands.", d=9.920, v="tauren-male-elder" },
		{ f="9501-b69e98a5", h="b69e98a5", t="If you put on cologne or perfume, then you'll see who is amorous.  Those are the ones who accept love tokens... and offer a gift in return.$B$BBut remember: to give someone a love token, you have to smell just right!  Men like the scent of perfume, while women prefer cologne.", d=22.680, v="tauren-male-elder" },
		{ f="9501-b852ea17", h="b852ea17", t="Ragefire Chasm consists of a network of volcanic caverns below the orcs' new capital city of Orgrimmar. Recently, rumors have spread that a cult loyal to the demonic Shadow Council has taken up residence within the Chasm's fiery depths. This cult, known as the Burning Blade, threatens the very sovereignty of Durotar. Many believe that the orc Warchief Thrall is aware of the Blade's existence and has chosen not to destroy it in the hopes that its members might lead him straight to the Shadow Council.  ", d=41.830, v="tauren-male-elder" },
		{ f="9501-b8eefffb", h="b8eefffb", t="Shadowfang Keep is in southern Silverpine just north of Pyrewood Village.", d=7.960, v="tauren-male-elder" },
		{ f="9501-b8ef9c65", h="b8ef9c65", t="The Stormwind Stockades are found near the mage quarter in Stormwind.", d=6.080, v="tauren-male-elder" },
		{ f="9501-c2bfa0cf", h="c2bfa0cf", t="Gnomeregan can be found in western Dun Morogh.", d=4.640, v="tauren-male-elder" },
		{ f="9501-ca5fde90", h="ca5fde90", t="Maraudon is located in the middle of the western coast of Desolace, in the Valley of Spears.", d=8.680, v="tauren-male-elder" },
		{ f="9501-d352a290", h="d352a290", t="Once the greatest gold production center in the human lands, the Dead Mines are now inhabited by the Defias Brotherhood, who have turned the dark tunnels into their private sanctum. It is rumored that the thieves have conscripted the clever goblins to help them build something terrible at the bottom of the mines - but what that may be is still uncertain. Rumor has it that the way into the Deadmines lies through the quiet, unassuming village of Moonbrook. ", d=35.990, v="tauren-male-elder" },
		{ f="9501-e013de07", h="e013de07", t="As the wind on the plains, you are always welcome here.", d=4.960, v="tauren-male-elder" },
		{ f="9501-e99614f5", h="e99614f5", t="The ruins of Zul'Farrak are located in the northwestern corner of the Tanaris Desert.", d=7.960, v="tauren-male-elder" },
		{ f="9501-f106f818", h="f106f818", t="Built twelve thousand years ago by a covert sect of night elf sorcerers, the ancient city of Eldre'Thalas was used to protect Queen Azshara's most prized arcane secrets. Though it was ravaged by the Great Sundering of the world, much of the wondrous city still stands as the imposing Dire Maul. The ruins' three distinct districts have been overrun by all manner of creatures - especially the spectral highborne, foul satyr and brutish ogres.  ", d=36.430, v="tauren-male-elder" },
		{ f="9501-f2218c4a", h="f2218c4a", t="Blackrock Mountain lies between Searing Gorge in the north and Burning Steppes in the south.", d=7.680, v="tauren-male-elder" },
		{ f="9501-f88f28f5", h="f88f28f5", t="Ragefire Chasm can be found beneath the Shadow Cleft in the center of Orgrimmar.", d=7.280, v="tauren-male-elder" },
		{ f="9501-f9fa0d11", h="f9fa0d11", t="When you give love tokens to townsfolk, you'll receive different gifts in return.  Some of those you'll want to keep and use, but others can be bundled together and given to your favorite hero!  Visit Kwee Q. Peddlefeet to turn them in.$B$BKwee can be found near Cairne, Sylvanas and Thrall.", d=21.440, v="tauren-male-elder" },
	},
	[9502] = {
		{ f="9502-47ebe592", h="47ebe592", t="I do not enjoy conversation.", d=2.320, v="narrator", n={ [1]=3.880 } },
	},
	[9528] = {
		{ f="9528-05a7fc0d", h="05a7fc0d", t="These once beautiful woods suffer under a terrible curse!  Corrupting forces twist the life here into shadows of their former selves.  If you are not an agent of this corruption, then perhaps you can aid me in reclaiming Felwood!", d=18.360, v="nightelf-female" },
		{ f="9528-5d572f1a", h="5d572f1a", t="\"Darnassae?\"$B$BThe night elf druid looks at you expectantly, but it is clear you cannot verbally communicate with her.  Undaunted, she points to herself and smiles.  She points at you and smiles once more.  She finally motions several times down the path to the north.$B$BPerhaps she is indicating that there is a druid you can speak to further up the road?", d=24.150, v="nightelf-female" },
		{ f="9528-62307646", h="62307646", t="I have observed four different kinds of plants that have been affected by the corruption: the songflower, the windblossom, the whipper root, and the night dragon plant.  The songflower and windblossom are common plants in Felwood, while the whipper root and night dragon are seen less frequently.  All are a vital part of Felwood's ecosystem.", d=24.830, v="nightelf-female" },
		{ f="9528-cbf51359", h="cbf51359", t="There are plants in Felwood that may be saved from corruption when Cenarion plant salve is applied to them.  I know how to make the salve from several different kinds of items; based on your skill set, you may find that you have multiple options to assist me.$B$BYou will also need a Cenarion beacon for your work here; it is a device that allows you to see the taint and corruption of nature that the naked eye will miss.", d=29.870, v="nightelf-female" },
	},
	[9529] = {
		{ f="9529-05a7fc0d", h="05a7fc0d", t="These once beautiful woods suffer under a terrible curse!  Corrupting forces twist the life here into shadows of their former selves.  If you are not an agent of this corruption, then perhaps you can aid me in reclaiming Felwood!", d=17.240, v="tauren-female" },
		{ f="9529-147152eb", h="147152eb", t="\"Taurahe?\"$B$BThe tauren druid looks at you expectantly, but it is clear you cannot verbally communicate with her.  Undaunted, she points to herself and smiles.  She points at you and smiles once more.  She finally motions several times down the path to the south.$B$BPerhaps she is indicating that there is a druid you can speak to further down the road? ", d=25.350, v="tauren-female" },
		{ f="9529-cbf51359", h="cbf51359", t="There are plants in Felwood that may be saved from corruption when Cenarion plant salve is applied to them.  I know how to make the salve from several different kinds of items; based on your skill set, you may find that you have multiple options to assist me.$B$BYou will also need a Cenarion beacon for your work here; it is a device that allows you to see the taint and corruption of nature that the naked eye will miss.", d=32.110, v="tauren-female" },
	},
	[9543] = {
		{ f="9543-005e0c21", h="005e0c21", t="Hello!  You're just the person I was looking for.  Take a seat and listen, because I have a plan that will make us both rich!", d=5.440, v="goblin-male" },
	},
	[9544] = {
		{ f="9544-a4be592a", h="a4be592a", t="Need some supplies?", d=1.680, v="goblin-female-s107" },
	},
	[9545] = {
		{ f="9545-125eaef6", h="125eaef6", t="If it weren't for the Grim Guzzler, I'd probably spend my free time pulling the wings off dragon whelps.", d=5.520, v="dwarf-male", s={ ["f"]=6.520 } },
		{ f="9545-16db227b", h="16db227b", t="If it weren't for the Grim Guzzler, I'd spend my free time pulling the wings off dragon whelps.", d=5.200, v="dwarf-male", s={ ["f"]=5.400 } },
		{ f="9545-36a7df95", h="36a7df95", t="If Hydraxis recruits more in his war, then it might shift the balance of power...", d=5.000, v="dwarf-male", s={ ["f"]=5.520 } },
		{ f="9545-8aecd6cd", h="8aecd6cd", t="The Waterlord Hydraxis hides off in Azshara, on an island in the Bay of Storms.  What kind of threat can the fool muster from there?", d=8.480, v="dwarf-male", s={ ["f"]=11.040 } },
		{ f="9545-8c831a42", h="8c831a42", t="Have a drink, $c.  It might be your last!", d=3.240, v="dwarf-male", s={ ["f"]=3.880 } },
		{ f="9545-b13d7e66", h="b13d7e66", t="I heard that a noble among the water elementals, Hydraxis, wages war with the servants of fire.  Let's hope he loses!", d=8.120, v="dwarf-male", s={ ["f"]=9.120 } },
		{ f="9545-e17a94c6", h="e17a94c6", t="The water elementals are at war with the fire elementals, which sort of means they're at war with us.  One of their leaders, Hydraxis, is mustering agents for his cause...", d=9.240, v="dwarf-male", s={ ["f"]=10.440 } },
		{ f="9545-e45e3890", h="e45e3890", t="Ragnaros will reign supreme!", d=2.640, v="dwarf-male", s={ ["f"]=2.840 } },
	},
	[9547] = {
		{ f="9547-11937a85", h="11937a85", t="Have you tried that Thunderbrew Lager?  It's good stuff!", d=4.320, v="dwarf-male", s={ ["f"]=4.400 } },
		{ f="9547-179bf396", h="179bf396", t="It's all guns and flames until someone loses and dies.", d=5.240, v="dwarf-male", s={ ["f"]=4.920 } },
		{ f="9547-30c8bc86", h="30c8bc86", t="My father told me there'd be days like this, where a stranger would talk to me and I'd have to restrain myself from killing $ghim:her;.", d=6.760, v="dwarf-male", g=true, s={ ["f"]=7.600 } },
		{ f="9547-67a640af", h="67a640af", t="I have duty in an hour, but until then... bottom's up!", d=4.360, v="dwarf-male", s={ ["f"]=4.800 } },
	},
	[9554] = {
		{ f="9554-8dddff62", h="8dddff62", t="I think Plugger filled one of his kegs too much.  It looks like it's about to blow!", d=4.720, v="dwarf-male", s={ ["f"]=5.080 } },
		{ f="9554-b713ca3c", h="b713ca3c", t="You looking at me, $gladdy:lassy;?", d=1.920, v="dwarf-male", g=true, s={ ["f"]=2.040 } },
		{ f="9554-bdca3565", h="bdca3565", t="I'll take a pint of Dark Iron ale.  Oh, you're not the $gwaiter:waitress;?", d=5.240, v="dwarf-male", g=true, s={ ["f"]=5.080 } },
		{ f="9554-e937cd6d", h="e937cd6d", t="Don't bother me while I'm partying...", d=2.040, v="dwarf-male", s={ ["f"]=2.120 } },
	},
	[9558] = {
		{ f="9558-18531f4a", h="18531f4a", t="You look like you might be needing passage across the Great Sea. Well you have come to the right place, this here is the berth of the Maiden's Fancy, finest passenger ship to travel these waters. When she arrives, just climb aboard and the next thing you know you will find yourself basking on the sandy beaches of Stranglethorn or throwing back a drink in Booty Bay.", d=22.065, v="goblin-male-zany" },
		{ f="9558-de45da2d", h="de45da2d", t="You look like you might be needing passage across the Great Sea. Well you have come to the right place, this here is the berth of the Maiden's Fancy, finest passenger ship to travel these waters. When she arrives, just climb aboard and the next thing you know you will find yourself basking on the sandy beaches of Stranglethorn.", d=19.537, v="goblin-male-zany" },
	},
	[9559] = {
		{ f="9559-c268d630", h="c268d630", t="I must say, Booty Bay has the best Clam Chowder to be had anywhere in the South Seas. Oh, not interested in cuisine eh? Well then let me be the first to welcome you to the berth of the Maiden's Fancy, the finest passenger ship to travel between the Eastern Kingdoms and Kalimdor. She's due back for another trip to Ratchet soon, so make yourself comfortable till she arrives.", d=26.647, v="goblin-male-gruff" },
		{ f="9559-c670fd35", h="c670fd35", t="I must say, Booty Bay has the best Clam Chowder to be had anywhere in the South Seas. Oh, not interested in cuisine eh? Well then let me be the first to welcome you to the berth of the Maiden's Fancy, the finest passenger ship to travel between the Eastern Kingdoms and Kalimdor. She's due back for another trip to Ratchet in the Barrens soon, so make yourself comfortable till she arrives.", d=52.110, v="goblin-male-gruff" },
	},
	[9563] = {
		{ f="9563-1c1f8875", h="1c1f8875", t="Dwarves don't get drunk, $g mister:missy;. I'm just a little sloppy.$B$BAnyhow, Windsor? I figure he's somewhere in Blackrock Depths. That's the Dark Iron city for you unedumecated peoples.", d=11.800, v="dwarf-male-grim", g=true },
		{ f="9563-2053e951", h="2053e951", t="Slow down! I was getting to that!$B$BSo there he was, standing tall with all the blood and guts dripping off him when who shows up?$B$BThe Dark Irons! Didn't you hear a word I said??$B$BWell, the Dark Irons are a little craftier than those Blackrock orcs. They came prepared. By prepared I mean there were about 300 of em... *hic* 'scuse me.", d=20.630, v="dwarf-male-grim" },
		{ f="9563-289dd4d8", h="289dd4d8", t="Me versus fifty orcs? I'm no fool, $n. My pappy always told me, 'Discreditin is the better part of a cracker,' or something, and I knew what that meant.", d=8.720, v="dwarf-male-grim" },
		{ f="9563-342d4249", h="342d4249", t="What you be wanting? *hic*", d=2.320, v="dwarf-male-grim" },
		{ f="9563-4c4bfc73", h="4c4bfc73", t="With pleasure... just let me savor this moment for a minute longer.", d=3.840, v="dwarf-male-grim" },
		{ f="9563-5721efe1", h="5721efe1", t="Died? Are you cracked, $n? Excuse me, $g Mister:Miss; $n! Windsor wouldn't have died from no fifty orcs. As sure as Thelsamar blood sausage is the tastiest food the world may ever know, there he stood: He was covered in orc chunks from head to toe, drenched in about eighteen layers of their blood, but he was definitely alive... and really, really angry.", d=22.470, v="dwarf-male-grim", g=true },
		{ f="9563-884cd640", h="884cd640", t="Windsor was particularly ornery that day - and believe me, for Windsor, that's a monumental accomplishment. He kept telling me that 'something feels off.' Well he wasn't kidding!$B$BWe were in the middle of Blackrock Mountain when the filthy animals attacked. I'm talking about the orcs, of course. Pay attention, will ya? All you could hear were grunts and the clanging of steel as they rushed us. ", d=21.990, v="dwarf-male-grim" },
		{ f="9563-88da739f", h="88da739f", t="Finally! Put some fingers in your ears, your brain mighta just grown five sizes and I'm worried it might leak out.$B$BSo, the Dark Irons spared his life and took him prisoner. Their leader, some self-important, uppity fella named Thauris-something, took Ironfoe for himself. And that was the last I saw of ol' Windsor... *hic* 'scuse me. ", d=19.230, v="dwarf-male-grim" },
		{ f="9563-8ea49005", h="8ea49005", t="Why do you keep saying he died? Who told you he died? I never said he died.$B$BHe went missing is all.$B$BYou see, apparently we had gotten into the middle of some big orc versus Dark Iron dwarf battle. The orcs, being the filthy, miserable curs that they are, were out early, setting up some traps and other diabolical things you probably wouldn't understand.", d=22.590, v="dwarf-male-grim" },
		{ f="9563-a3d37687", h="a3d37687", t="Yep. You never heard of Ironfoe? The legendary orc slaying hammer? Yep, yep, that was ol' Windsor's hammer. He told me that Franclorn Forgewright himself made that hammer for his great, great, grand pappy. THE Franclorn Forgewright: The Dark Iron responsible for stonewrought archimetenc... building stuff. He also said the hammer had a twin that Franclorn kept for himself. Think he called it Ironfel or something.", d=23.510, v="dwarf-male-grim" },
		{ f="9563-af7a4527", h="af7a4527", t="Alright, alright. Anyhow, so I sorta slipped into the shadows.$B$BThat didn't sit too well with Windsor, seeing as how he was already extra cranky. Well he started spinnin' old Ironfoe around and screaming like a mad man at the orcs. ", d=12.840, v="dwarf-male-grim" },
		{ f="9563-b705eb63", h="b705eb63", t="Aright *hic*... Say, you look familiar *hic*. Have I ever told you about the time me and Windsor fought off thir, er... a thous... a million orcs?$B$BOh settle down friend, this is a good one!", d=12.480, v="dwarf-male-grim" },
		{ f="9563-d3f0a004", h="d3f0a004", t="$G Mister:Missy;, if I didn't know better, I'd think you were one of them 'special' peoples. We call em Troggs.$B$BWindsor didn't have no beef with the Dark Irons, after all, his great, great, grand pappy's best friend was a Dark Iron. Which is also probably why that army of Dark Irons didn't kill him on sight.", d=15.720, v="dwarf-male-grim", g=true },
		{ f="9563-fbc48bb6", h="fbc48bb6", t="So where was I? Oh yea, so the orcs rushed Windsor and Windsor, well, he didn't move an inch. He stood tall as they charged him, ten at a time. All I could see was the glow from Ironfoe and a lot of blood. This went on for hours, maybe days. I don't remember. Anyhow, FINALLY, it stopped.", d=17.680, v="dwarf-male-grim" },
	},
	[9564] = {
		{ f="9564-8d6952f8", h="8d6952f8", t="Of course there's no danger in everything catching flames and exploding like a huge helium bomb. This baby will get you to Undercity faster and safer than any boat, and the view is truly breathtaking. Speaking of breath, smoking is not allowed while on board the zeppelin, and fire spells are banned from being cast during the trip.", d=19.303, v="goblin-male-zany" },
	},
	[9566] = {
		{ f="9566-fc033aae", h="fc033aae", t="My brother said we could make great money with this trade route, but he didn't tell me I would be the one living on this side. If you come back this way on the Zeppelin, could you bring me something to eat? They sell some of the finest meat in Orgrimmar, and I sure could use something that didn't die weeks before it stopped moving.", d=15.600, v="goblin-male-zany" },
	},
	[9584] = {
		{ f="9584-fd111c9e", h="fd111c9e", t="Between the light and the dark, there is shadow... and those shadows have powers you have yet to see.", d=5.680, v="human-female-warrior" },
	},
	[9616] = {
		{ f="9616-4f20d591", h="4f20d591", t="Amazing, aren't they? All these artifacts and remains.$B$BI'm not sure what I'm more impressed by, their size, or the stories that go along with them. There's so much to study and learn. And the connections we can make...$B$BDid you know rumor has it that many races have the same heritage as Night elves?", d=13.856, v="gnome-male-standard" },
		{ f="9616-516f3225", h="516f3225", t="No, not that I can tell. It seems to be mostly based on region. Some races have labled them slimes, some oozes. It seems to be preference mostly.$B$BEvery time I've encountered ooze, sludge, or slime they have basically been the same creatures. The differences seem to be based on their environment, which is why we need a pure sample.", d=17.231, v="gnome-male-standard" },
		{ f="9616-6fe5358d", h="6fe5358d", t="A pure sample would be one that's uncorrupted by unintentional influences. We need to find the creatures in the most basic, normal environment we can.$B$BThat means somewhere devoid of civilization or the effects of the dominant races of Azeroth. Someplace... untouched.", d=14.197, v="gnome-male-standard" },
		{ f="9616-e9afccda", h="e9afccda", t="Look at these samples! What does it mean? What does it mean? I'm going to need time, time to look at all this information. And I'll need more information. Information I can't get... damn! Think, Laris, think!$B$BWhat are you going to do? What?!$B$BThere has to be a solution!", d=12.712, v="gnome-male-standard" },
		{ f="9616-fd6b4cb6", h="fd6b4cb6", t="It'll definitely not be anywhere in the Eastern Kingdoms, that's for sure.$B$BIt'll have to be somwhere on Kalimdor, but still far enough away from the Horde and other races. Someplace unaffected by the Sundering--that means no where near the Night elves' civilization either.$B$BI would guess it'd be someplace protected also... like a valley, or a crater. I don't know. I'm just guessing now. I'm sorry I couldn't help you more.", d=20.419, v="gnome-male-standard" },
	},
	[9618] = {
		{ f="9618-8f5b36d8", h="8f5b36d8", t="Have you seen all the wonderful things here in Ungoro Crater, $n? It's simply amazing. Not as amazing as some of the things I can make with my skill at engineering, but for it being all natural here... it's not too bad.$B$BMy uncle Remtravel loves old stuff like this place. I'm following in his footsteps kinda--I want to discover new things from lost cultures too!", d=21.110, v="dwarf-female-young" },
	},
	[9619] = {
		{ f="9619-226ee721", h="226ee721", t="You've started down an honorable path, $n. My ancestors respect your willingness, but you will not have my approval until you have followed through with my tasks.$B$BYou know what you must do if you wish to prove yourself a hunter in spirit.", d=18.200, v="tauren-male-shaman" },
		{ f="9619-a799ffa3", h="a799ffa3", t="The ravasaur here in Un'Goro seem to be related to the raptors of the barrens--highly intelligent, volatile, and with a sense or code of conduct. The greatest of these that I have encountered is  Lar'korwi. He is one of the most dangerous beasts I've ever seen. In taurahe, Lar'korwi means \"sharp claw,\" but that does not do him justice.$B$BDo not underestimate Lar'korwi if you ever plan on hunting him, but I will help you in any way I can if you do.", d=38.430, v="tauren-male-shaman" },
		{ f="9619-d8916cb7", h="d8916cb7", t="Greetings, $c. For some, the hunter is a way of life, a chosen profession. For others, it is something of a pastime, a badge of courage, or a rite of passage depending on your tribe.$B$BFor me, race and profession mean nothing--it is the testing of your spirit and mind that I respect. For one to stand against the forces of nature and test all of their skills is the true mark of honor.$B$BIf you wish to test yourself and earn my respect, then speak to me more.", d=33.630, v="tauren-male-shaman" },
	},
	[9620] = {
		{ f="9620-5efb22d3", h="5efb22d3", t="Throm-Ka, $c. My mood is poor this day, so please, unless you can help me, I would prefer to be alone.", d=8.476, v="orc-female-warrior" },
	},
	[9676] = {
		{ f="9676-864f58c6", h="864f58c6", t="This may come as a shock to you, but business hasn't been all that good as of late...", d=4.045, v="gnome-male-standard" },
	},
	[9679] = {
		{ f="9679-82d17b1e", h="82d17b1e", t="Did Crest send you?", d=1.692, v="human-male-standard" },
	},
	[9836] = {
		{ f="9836-c279844b", h="c279844b", t="Ah, so... you have found it.$B$B<Mathredis points to the book in your possession.>$B$BHave you collected the necessary components?$B$BThe manifestations listed in the libram, imbecile!", d=7.760, v="bloodelf-male", P={ { d=2.080 }, { d=3.400, n=true }, { d=6.440 } }, nP={ [1]={ [2]=3.640 } } },
		{ f="9836-e98c18f5", h="e98c18f5", t="They are lost, $r. Librams written by the elven masters. Scattered across the world when the Scourge was unleashed upon Quel'Thalas.$B$BNow we search for these librams. Search to find the secrets they hold - to restore power once had.$B$BI search for the ten written by Master Kariel Winthalus. Should you find a libram, allow me to absorb its magical properties and for you I shall craft an amalgamation of power... of course, all things come at some cost. You will find my cost to be high; but pay you shall.", d=30.910, v="bloodelf-male" },
	},
	[9937] = {
		{ f="9937-7c977ea2", h="7c977ea2", t="Grrr...", d=1.640, v="narrator", n={ [1]=0.560 } },
	},
	[9990] = {
		{ f="9990-94cf8b7a", h="94cf8b7a", t="This was the site of a great battle.  Many great battles.", d=4.920, v="npc-9574" },
	},
	[9997] = {
		{ f="9997-6af523bf", h="6af523bf", t="Welcome to the refuge, $n. Some come here with a purpose, others found their way here by accident... But everyone here seems to have a unique story to tell.", d=12.360, v="goblin-female-s107" },
	},
	[10042] = {
		{ f="10042-7c977ea2", h="7c977ea2", t="Grrr...", d=1.520, v="narrator", n={ [1]=2.240 } },
	},
	[10043] = {
		{ f="10043-8dddff62", h="8dddff62", t="I think Plugger filled one of his kegs too much.  It looks like it's about to blow!", d=5.680, v="tauren-male" },
		{ f="10043-b713ca3c", h="b713ca3c", t="You looking at me, $gladdy:lassy;?", d=2.040, v="tauren-male", g=true },
		{ f="10043-bdca3565", h="bdca3565", t="I'll take a pint of Dark Iron ale.  Oh, you're not the $gwaiter:waitress;?", d=6.480, v="tauren-male", g=true },
		{ f="10043-e937cd6d", h="e937cd6d", t="Don't bother me while I'm partying...", d=2.240, v="tauren-male" },
	},
	[10086] = {
		{ f="10086-0e051c59", h="0e051c59", t="You've come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?", d=3.174, v="tauren-male-warrior" },
		{ f="10086-4ef1d72e", h="4ef1d72e", t="Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets.", d=3.548, v="tauren-male-warrior" },
	},
	[10088] = {
		{ f="10088-0e051c59", h="0e051c59", t="You've come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?", d=5.080, v="troll-male-standard" },
		{ f="10088-4ef1d72e", h="4ef1d72e", t="Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets.", d=5.320, v="troll-male-standard" },
		{ f="10088-d56cf43b", h="d56cf43b", t="You can't teach an old dog new tricks.  At least that's what someone once told me.  Lucky for you, I've discovered it to be untrue.  However, pets do tend to get resistant to the technique, and I need more food each time to keep them happy.  What that means is that you'll owe me more money the more times I untrain the same pet.  Now then, would you like me to start untraining?", d=29.950, v="troll-male-standard" },
	},
	[10089] = {
		{ f="10089-0e051c59", h="0e051c59", t="You've come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?", d=3.520, v="nightelf-female-priestess" },
		{ f="10089-4ef1d72e", h="4ef1d72e", t="Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets.", d=3.960, v="nightelf-female-priestess" },
	},
	[10090] = {
		{ f="10090-0e051c59", h="0e051c59", t="You've come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?", d=3.210, v="dwarf-female-maternal" },
		{ f="10090-4ef1d72e", h="4ef1d72e", t="Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets.", d=2.949, v="dwarf-female-maternal" },
	},
	[10118] = {
		{ f="10118-c6fbc16f", h="c6fbc16f", t="The fish off the coast of Teldrassil are quite large and robust.  Rumors say it is the speedy growth of our new world tree that is the cause.", d=9.576, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
	},
	[10136] = {
		{ f="10136-247af32b", h="247af32b", t="Lady Sylvanas has ordered the investigation of some of the natural phenomena of Azeroth. She feels there is something great to be learned from its secretive past.$B$BI know not how she learned such things, but I trust her completely, so I will do my best.$B$BI am currently investigating slimes, oozes and such. The creatures all seem to be similar in make up, but greatly affected by their environment.$B$BI could use your help in gathering samples of the creatures..", d=37.470, v="scourge-male-standard" },
		{ f="10136-b4b53bc1", h="b4b53bc1", t="My brother and I have dedicated ourselves to Sylvanas. She is our beacon of light when times were darkest. We sacrifice ourselves day in and day out to ensure our kind overcome the destiny that's chosen us.  We will not remain weak. We will take that which is owed to us. We will return tenfold, the pain that was done to us. And we shall do so with smiles on our faces.", d=31.590, v="scourge-male-standard" },
	},
	[10162] = {
		{ f="10162-4de62499", h="4de62499", t="It's simple really. Allow me to summarize... ", d=3.346, v="human-male" },
		{ f="10162-b7506402", h="b7506402", t="Do you expect me to cower before the mighty legion of $n?$B$BYou are nothing to me. Less than nothing. Had I desired your head, it would have been presented to me on a pike.$B$BYou have made the mistake that all mortals make.$B$B<Lord Victor Nefarius sighs.>$B$BTime does strange things to those that use it as a form of currency. ", d=18.110, v="human-male", P={ { d=13.031 }, { d=2.720, n=true }, { d=4.847 } }, nP={ [1]={ [2]=2.600 } } },
		{ f="10162-d1b3bae1", h="d1b3bae1", t="In your rush to glory, you assumed that the pace of the game revolved around your actions. Can you even fathom how preposterous that sounds to a being like me? A being that if so inclined could cause your own insignificant thoughts to crush the peanut sized mass of grey matter floating within your skull. ", d=20.659, v="human-male" },
	},
	[10181] = {
		{ f="10181-6887b693", h="6887b693", t="I've heard of you. Windshapers. Wayward children of ancient Eldre'Thalas.    I once would have called you kin--albeit distant kin. Now I have no more in common with elfkind than I have with any of the other living races. All I value from any creature that draws breath is how well they may further the goals of the Forsaken. Make yourself useful to my people, and you will be welcome in our lands.    Go. Explore the Undercity as you like and enjoy its comforts, such as they are. Just remember, nothing escapes my notice within my own domain.", d=40.595, v="npc-11657" },
		{ f="10181-e57781c5", h="e57781c5", t="<Lady Sylvanas Windrunner regards you silently.>", P={ { d=3.400, n=true } }, nP={ [1]={ [1]=4.720 } } },
	},
	[10182] = {
		{ f="10182-264b8b9f", h="264b8b9f", t="Greetings, $c. I am Rexxar, champion of the Horde, servant of Thrall, master to the beasts of the wilds.", d=10.880, v="orc-male-guard" },
	},
	[10216] = {
		{ f="10216-1147bc15", h="1147bc15", t="...pan fried, deep fried, and stir fried...", d=2.880, v="dwarf-male-standard" },
		{ f="10216-f0576b7b", h="f0576b7b", t="Hi there.  I'm Gubber Blump.", d=3.880, v="dwarf-male-standard" },
	},
	[10219] = {
		{ f="10219-572db4df", h="572db4df", t="May Elune walk with you, $c.  The Temple of the Moon has come to help the troubled citizens of Auberdine.", d=8.400, v="nightelf-female-priestess" },
	},
	[10266] = {
		{ f="10266-3852bbda", h="3852bbda", t="Snarl calls me simple because I am too slow. I just want to do the job right, and that takes time.", d=9.137, v="orc-male-standard" },
		{ f="10266-6e63d362", h="6e63d362", t="You learn quickly, that is not a bad thing. Just be sure to do the job right, as long as it takes to do so. Now, I fear I must send you to Snarl to learn more. Learn what he can teach, but do not listen to his angry words. He gets that way when Saru's daughters laugh at him.", d=19.500, v="orc-male-standard" },
		{ f="10266-b17b8494", h="b17b8494", t="I can show you what you wish to know, but you must be patient. Take your time to work the steel and feel the way it shapes beneath your hammer. When you become one with the steel, then you will understand.", d=11.939, v="orc-male-standard" },
	},
	[10267] = {
		{ f="10267-5b83aa12", h="5b83aa12", t="The Burning Steppes is a dangerous place, but scholars like me will do almost anything to advance our knowledge.", d=6.720, v="goblin-female-s107" },
	},
	[10276] = {
		{ f="10276-2024fca2", h="2024fca2", t="The life of a smith is not an easy one, but it puts steel in yer bones and fire in yer heart. My da' was a smith, my grandfather before him in the forges beneath Grim Batol. And now my son follows in our footsteps, that boy makes me proud.", d=18.360, v="dwarf-male-guard" },
		{ f="10276-2846a7fb", h="2846a7fb", t="A fast learner is what ye are, and a good smith to boot. I would sign off on yer work any day of the week. But I sense ye still have some learnin in ye. Go talk to Bengus Deepforge, he's a hard taskmaster but he's also one of the best.", d=17.360, v="dwarf-male-guard" },
		{ f="10276-9e51bf8f", h="9e51bf8f", t="Sorry $g lad : lass;, ye aren't quite up to the challenge of learning from me. Go see my son Groum, it would make his day to get a new apprentice.", d=10.120, v="dwarf-male-guard", g=true },
		{ f="10276-d6f17c90", h="d6f17c90", t="Aye, I would love ta teach ye a thing or two about smithing. Grab an apron and a hammer and let's see what we can accomplish shall we?", d=9.000, v="dwarf-male-guard" },
	},
	[10277] = {
		{ f="10277-a14963d0", h="a14963d0", t="Ye've got a little skill on ye. Enough to learn ye a few things I wager. Let's see what I can teach ye, shall we?", d=7.080, v="dwarf-male-grim" },
		{ f="10277-a7662787", h="a7662787", t="Eh? I don't have time ta chat, my da' wants me ta finish this order fer him.", d=4.720, v="dwarf-male-grim" },
		{ f="10277-de38fa19", h="de38fa19", t="Ye know more than I do, that's a certainty. Tell ye what though, go talk with me da'. He'll want ye ta prove yerself, but he is a fine teacher indeed. His name's Rotgath, and ye'll find him near the anvils workin steel for ol' Bengus.", d=12.480, v="dwarf-male-grim" },
	},
	[10278] = {
		{ f="10278-46a7802e", h="46a7802e", t="Karn says we need to listen to the spirits of the forge and of the steel, that they will guide us. I hear nothing but a ringing in my ears. Here, take a hammer and let us try to hear the spirits together.", d=9.987, v="tauren-male-warrior" },
		{ f="10278-af34ad47", h="af34ad47", t="I guess the spirits like you better than me, I still have not heard their call but you seem to have gathered their lessons well. Go speak to Karn, he will be excited to see one who hears them as he does.", d=11.208, v="tauren-male-warrior" },
		{ f="10278-b24d3eb1", h="b24d3eb1", t="I listen and I listen but I don't hear these spirits that Karn speaks of. ", d=6.653, v="tauren-male-warrior" },
	},
	[10296] = {
		{ f="10296-3255b4e1", h="3255b4e1", t="You must find one amongst the wretch in the lower portion of this citadel that has attained an Unadorned Seal of Ascension. It is a great honor for one of the lesser beings to obtain this item, as it is the first step in gaining access to the upper citadel and becoming one of Nefarian's elite guardsmen - the Blackhand legion. Find such an item and return it to me so that I may examine its properties. I will know how to proceed once my inspection of the seal is complete.", d=26.873, v="human-male-official" },
		{ f="10296-676c96d7", h="676c96d7", t="In decades past - of now ancient wars and conflicts - our kind was driven to the brink of extinction. Much we have endured, $r.$B$BThe onslaught of the Burning Legion. The Demon Soul. The Aspects divided. The ascension of Deathwing. The enslavement of our Queen, Alexstrasza, by the Dragonmaw.$B$BThrough it all, we have been the unshakable will of the dragons - the undaunted force that has fought to represent our waning existence in this world.", d=28.339, v="human-male-official" },
		{ f="10296-848dd8f2", h="848dd8f2", t="Be warned, mortal, it is exceptionally rare that one of the lesser clans in this citadel would hold such an item. Your search could take decades. I recommend you destroy these beasts without impunity.", d=11.589, v="human-male-official" },
		{ f="10296-8ff4ff75", h="8ff4ff75", t="It is possible for one, not of dragon kind, to obtain the Adorned Seal of Ascension and pass through the protected barrier. While possession of such an item would surely destroy me, perhaps you could utilize it and lower the barrier. ", d=12.619, v="human-male-official" },
		{ f="10296-9afac864", h="9afac864", t="Before his banishment, Deathwing was attempting to create impure offspring. Half breeds that would not only be immune to the innate natural powers and abilities of their Aspects but also under the complete control of Deathwing.$B$BIt seems that where his father failed, Nefarian may have succeeded - at least partially.$B$BIt was Ysera, Aspect of Dreams, who saw the abominations and forced us to act. If these 'Chromatic' dragonkin exist, they must be destroyed.", d=28.839, v="human-male-official" },
		{ f="10296-ac43ea1e", h="ac43ea1e", t="Perhaps I should tell you why I am here.$B$BDo you know of the Aspect, Deathwing? Or of his progeny, Nefarian and Onyxia?", d=8.314, v="human-male-official" },
		{ f="10296-c6ac52cd", h="c6ac52cd", t="Indeed. I stand before you in a form that you can comprehend, mortal. Surely, you could not bear to stand in the presence of the dragon known as Vaelastrasz.$B$B<Vaelan laughs.>$B$BShall I continue?", d=11.046, v="human-male-official", P={ { d=8.992 }, { d=1.280, n=true }, { d=1.408 } }, nP={ [1]={ [2]=1.560 } } },
		{ f="10296-d093ee46", h="d093ee46", t="Indeed. The item was ultimately destroyed and Deathwing nearly slain by the combined and renewed power of the four remaining Aspects. Where Deathwing is now is unknown. What we do know, however, is that one of his progeny, Nefarian, rules this citadel and wishes to continue where his father left off.", d=19.537, v="human-male-official" },
		{ f="10296-d5f18282", h="d5f18282", t="Deathwing, or Neltharion as he was once known, was the Aspect that embodied the strength of the world - granted almost limitless power over this mortal realm by the Titan shaper known as Khaz'goroth: Forger of the world.$B$BThrough treachery and deceit, the foul one convinced the four other Aspects to imbue an item, known as the Demon Soul, with their powers - greatly weakening them, forcing a division among the once great Aspects.  ", d=26.821, v="human-male-official" },
		{ f="10296-e6563072", h="e6563072", t="Do not bring it any closer, mortal. I can sense the evil coursing through the seal from where I stand.$B$BGive me a moment to inspect the item - hold it firmly.", d=9.372, v="human-male-official" },
		{ f="10296-f195e2de", h="f195e2de", t="It is not our way, nor would it be possible. Nefarian is guarded by ancient wards, as old as the Aspects themselves. It is what prevents me from entering the inner sanctum of this citadel. The dark magic prevents any of the other flight to enter without being ordained... unless.", d=16.116, v="human-male-official" },
	},
	[10300] = {
		{ f="10300-4b920368", h="4b920368", t="Thanks again, $n! I'm very pleased with what we found.$B$BGood luck to you!", d=5.131, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="10300-e099a3df", h="e099a3df", t="Hi! I just got back from exploring the Ruins of Kel'Theril, to the southwest. Now I'm intent on investigating the Wildkin that lie just up the ridge here, in Owl Wing Thicket.$B$BHave you spoken to Erelas Ambersky in Rut'theran Village? He requested that I come here, and perhaps he has a task for you as well.", d=21.566, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="10300-e439a6f0", h="e439a6f0", t="I'm getting ready to travel up the ridge, $n. I could use some help -- would you like to come with me?", d=6.303, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
	},
	[10301] = {
		{ f="10301-a966daec", h="a966daec", t="Being part of the Explorers' League, I've been hunting for artifacts in the area. Winterspring is said to contain very magical items... Most are highly guarded.", d=10.000, v="dwarf-male-standard" },
	},
	[10304] = {
		{ f="10304-0afb1bed", h="0afb1bed", t="Enchanted thorium is a highly sought-after metal. You best chance of finding some of it is to speak with an artisan blacksmith or miner.", d=8.120, v="bloodelf-female" },
		{ f="10304-3c206849", h="3c206849", t="My people, they are as shattered as the relic you seek to repair.", d=4.680, v="bloodelf-female" },
		{ f="10304-c3e87df2", h="c3e87df2", t="Crystal Restore is a difficult item to acquire.$B$BI believe that it comes from Un'Goro Crater, so you'd best head there.", d=9.240, v="bloodelf-female" },
		{ f="10304-df81967d", h="df81967d", t="Please, leave this place, $n. You know nothing of what troubles us...", d=4.880, v="bloodelf-female" },
		{ f="10304-f09d3346", h="f09d3346", t="Why have you come here, $c?", d=2.920, v="bloodelf-female" },
	},
	[10305] = {
		{ f="10305-323cb151", h="323cb151", t="I'll get the last laugh... they'll see! Oh, hi $c, I didn't see you there.", d=6.120, v="goblin-female-s107" },
		{ f="10305-4421ff52", h="4421ff52", t="Invention, my dear $c, is two percent bottled inspiration, four percent solar exposure, six percent chance of thunderstorms clearing by mid-afternoon, and ninety-three percent Rumplesnicker.$B$BWait, did that add to one hundred? I've got my notes around here somewhere.", d=17.600, v="goblin-female-s107" },
		{ f="10305-85485798", h="85485798", t="Why is it that there's never a gyrochronatom lying around when you need one?", d=4.840, v="goblin-female-s107" },
		{ f="10305-e64ca954", h="e64ca954", t="Mighty fine weather we're having here, wouldn't you say?", d=3.280, v="goblin-female-s107" },
	},
	[10307] = {
		{ f="10307-022ff8de", h="022ff8de", t="Da Cache of Mau'ari holds great secrets... The shards used ta make it are reflective, and you can use its shiny surface ta siphon power from other tings and den reflect it onto yourself.$B$BKeeping da charm in your inventory lets you collect e'ko, da spiritual power from the beasts you fight. Once you find e'ko, you bring it ta Mau'ari.", d=25.283, v="troll-female-laidback" },
		{ f="10307-1873d6a4", h="1873d6a4", t="Mau'ari know why you seek her out...$B$BBring me da E'ko you find in the world, an' I can transform it for you.", d=8.566, v="troll-female-laidback" },
		{ f="10307-cebcabd3", h="cebcabd3", t="Ah am very surprised that one wit such a careless nature has gotten dis far...$B$BYah, you may have another charm, but Mau'ari is very displeased wit your actions!$B$BGo, now. ", d=14.748, v="troll-female-laidback" },
		{ f="10307-d48331fd", h="d48331fd", t="E'ko is da power dat each creatures possesses. Da charm I made for ya allows you ta capture it in a physical manifestation.$B$BI know an incantation dat can transform da e'ko you find, and turn it into juju.$B$BYou can den take the Cache of Mau'ari, an' use it ta reflect da power of da juju onto yourself.$B$BC'mon, give it a try. Bring da e'ko ta Mau'ari an' we have some fun.", d=34.737, v="troll-female-laidback" },
		{ f="10307-ddeae011", h="ddeae011", t="Ah, $r... I possess great knowledge a' da world and how ta create charms a' great power. ", d=8.404, v="troll-female-laidback" },
	},
	[10360] = {
		{ f="10360-54d735c8", h="54d735c8", t="$N, the Silverwing Sentinels must be crushed!  Are you ready for Warsong Gulch?", d=7.880, v="orc-male-guard" },
		{ f="10360-7e5b36ab", h="7e5b36ab", t="I am sorry $c, but you are not seasoned enough yet to enter Warsong Gulch.", d=9.040, v="orc-male-guard" },
	},
	[10378] = {
		{ f="10378-4fa5b9c3", h="4fa5b9c3", t="Where can I send you today $c?", d=2.303, v="tauren-male-warrior" },
		{ f="10378-5d1f9ab4", h="5d1f9ab4", t="Treat the wind rider well as it takes you to your destination.  May your ancestors watch over you $N.", d=6.506, v="tauren-male-warrior" },
		{ f="10378-6bdb24d7", h="6bdb24d7", t="Many are the paths of the Earth Mother.  Wherever you decide to travel, may she watch over you.", d=6.790, v="tauren-male-warrior" },
		{ f="10378-8b4f80e7", h="8b4f80e7", t="Though the Crossroads seems to be the center of activity in The Barrens, I prefer the quietude of Camp Taurajo.  Where shall I send you?", d=8.047, v="tauren-male-warrior" },
	},
	[10428] = {
		{ f="10428-74518b5c", h="74518b5c", t="Whitereach Post started off as a small hunting camp... Now, everyone wants to set up shop and call this home.  <Motega shrugs his shoulder>", d=6.750, v="tauren-male-warrior", P={ { d=6.689 }, { d=2.320, n=true } }, nP={ [1]={ [2]=2.120 } } },
	},
	[10431] = {
		{ f="10431-9b95be26", h="9b95be26", t="Greetings, my friend.  May the Dawn keep you well in these troubled times.", d=5.899, v="human-male-warrior" },
	},
	[10432] = {
		{ f="10432-a02b6ba6", h="a02b6ba6", t="What, may I ask, are you doing here?  Put on your student's attire, and study!", d=5.760, v="narrator", n={ [1]=6.600 } },
		{ f="10432-be1a6a30", h="be1a6a30", t="Have you come from the Burning Steppes?  Do you have my black dragon eggs?", d=6.920, v="narrator", n={ [1]=5.880 } },
		{ f="10432-cbd67dc0", h="cbd67dc0", t="Be silent!  Do you think our plagued dragons will hatch and train themselves?", d=4.520, v="narrator", n={ [1]=6.280 } },
	},
	[10433] = {
		{ f="10433-414c8540", h="414c8540", t="Your mind is unfocused.  Are you hiding something from me?", d=5.840, v="scourge-male" },
		{ f="10433-8f001b33", h="8f001b33", t="Your future is clouded.  Concentrate, and ask again.", d=5.760, v="scourge-male" },
		{ f="10433-b632c7c3", h="b632c7c3", t="I sense a disturbance, lurking around you...", d=3.520, v="scourge-male" },
		{ f="10433-dc22d439", h="dc22d439", t="You don't look like a student...", d=2.440, v="scourge-male" },
	},
	[10445] = {
		{ f="10445-26d03d5a", h="26d03d5a", t="I highly recommend that you visit Sayge to get your fortune told. I know, I know... he's a gnoll.  But he's a very special gnoll with the power to divine your future!$B$BAnd we are constantly expanding the faire with all manner of new attractions!", d=20.720, v="scourge-female-standard" },
		{ f="10445-2d956b63", h="2d956b63", t="Glad you asked. Darkmoon Faire Prize Tickets are our way of letting you help with the faire, and in return you can turn in your tickets for special prizes!  To get started you'll want to talk to Chronos, Kerri Hicks, Ringling and Yebb Nebblegear to see who you can best help. They always have something that needs doing to improve and expand our attractions.  Then when you have enough tickets, speak with Gelvas Grimegate and he will give you a list of prizes to choose from. ", d=35.990, v="scourge-female-standard" },
		{ f="10445-6535b785", h="6535b785", t="Hello $c, and welcome to the Darkmoon Faire. There is so much to do here at the faire that it can be a little overwhelming for our first time visitors. That's why I'm here to help. Do you have any questions?", d=16.680, v="scourge-female-standard" },
		{ f="10445-6996bd87", h="6996bd87", t="The Blastenheimer 5000 Ultra Cannon is a state-of-the-art single person projectile device. Delivering its payload at near the speed of a dragon, the cannon is the pride and joy of the Blastenheimer family, world renown for their aeronautical and combustible feats!$B$BIf you'd like to be launched through the skies to fly free as a bird, seek out Maxima Blastenheimer on the south edge of Thunder Bluff's Hunter Rise. She'll aim you at the target far to south on Stonebull Lake!", d=38.550, v="scourge-female-standard" },
		{ f="10445-90c72f4e", h="90c72f4e", t="No one really knows who made the Darkmoon Cards or what their true purpose is, but I can tell you that they have been found all over Azeroth, usually in the hands of a villain attempting to unlock their mysteries.  There are four types of Darkmoon Cards; Beasts, Elementals, Portals and Warlords, with eight cards, Ace to Eight in each suit. If you collect all eight of one suit then you can turn them into a deck that you can give to our Professor Thaddeus Paleo in exchange for a powerful trinket. ", d=39.590, v="scourge-female-standard" },
		{ f="10445-dd065c49", h="dd065c49", t="Our newest attraction, and at no cost to you I might add, these miniature tanks, or Tonks as we've cleverly named them, can be controlled from any of the Tonk Control Consoles spread throughout the faire.$B$BAll that you have to do is activate an available control console. Each tonk will come equipped with a stock set of devices, and a random special power to unleash upon your enemy!$B$BHold epic battles with your friends, cruise around, or just cause wild mayhem... the choice is yours!", d=35.910, v="scourge-female-standard" },
		{ f="10445-f1563586", h="f1563586", t="An excellent question! We have many things for sale here at the faire. If you are interested in food and drink, then head over to Stamp and Sylannia's booth. My favorite is the Darkmoon Special Reserve.  If you'd rather purchase something more exotic, then Lhara may have just the thing for you. She specializes in rarities from all over the world.  And then there is Flik running around here somewhere. If you can grab him he sells balls for throwing and frogs to keep as pets. ", d=33.830, v="scourge-female-standard" },
	},
	[10475] = {
		{ f="10475-06214378", h="06214378", t="Be silent!  I cannot afford to miss even a moment of this lecture!", d=4.265, v="human-female", s={ ["m"]=4.805 } },
		{ f="10475-271618c8", h="271618c8", t="We must focus if we are to spawn our dragonflight!", d=3.288, v="human-female", s={ ["m"]=3.760 } },
		{ f="10475-829e107a", h="829e107a", t="Did you forget your student's attire?  Do you think fashion is more vital than the Scourge's domination?", d=4.946, v="human-female", s={ ["m"]=6.485 } },
		{ f="10475-96c09597", h="96c09597", t="Did you finish yesterday's assignment?  If so, then sit by me!", d=3.723, v="human-female", s={ ["m"]=4.672 } },
		{ f="10475-9e03e2cf", h="9e03e2cf", t="Be quiet!  Can't you see the master is speaking?", d=3.210, v="human-female", s={ ["m"]=3.537 } },
		{ f="10475-a7546edd", h="a7546edd", t="Did you bring your text books?  Can I look on with you?", d=2.910, v="human-female", s={ ["m"]=4.112 } },
		{ f="10475-d5d8022c", h="d5d8022c", t="Spend less time rattling and more time listening.", d=3.138, v="human-female", s={ ["m"]=3.868 } },
		{ f="10475-f2bf5cd8", h="f2bf5cd8", t="Watch your step in here, $gboy:girl;.  The master sees all...", d=3.216, v="human-female", g=true, s={ ["m"]=4.192 } },
	},
	[10537] = {
		{ f="10537-c27b3101", h="c27b3101", t="We cannot take care of all the threats in this area alone. We could use another fighting hand, $N. ", d=10.880, v="tauren-male-elder" },
	},
	[10540] = {
		{ f="10540-5004ab66", h="5004ab66", t="Ah yes, I heard of the Windshapers. It be good to be meetin' you now.    You know, my people been fighting elves for thousands of years. If you be half as fierce as your cousins from Darnassus or Quel'thalas, the Darkspear would be glad to call you friend.    I be wishin' you well in your travels, $c. We Darkspear know all too well what it's like to have no home, so I hope you be finding what your people need to save yours.", d=31.110, v="troll-male" },
		{ f="10540-7c6995ef", h="7c6995ef", t="I am Vol'jin, of the Darkspear. Do you be friend, or enemy?", d=6.040, v="troll-male" },
	},
	[10578] = {
		{ f="10578-4ad7f83c", h="4ad7f83c", t="Ya mon, I be Gadrin's assistant.  Dis here volunteer work be my way of gettin through Witch Doctor School.  Since you help him, I help ya for free.  Whatcha need fixin?", d=12.020, v="npc-9911" },
		{ f="10578-a23e2e4e", h="a23e2e4e", t="Heya mon.  Go talk to mah Master Gadrin right over there.  Take care of that Zalazane crazy for him and I fix ya right up!", d=9.100, v="npc-9911" },
	},
	[10583] = {
		{ f="10583-c5ceacbe", h="c5ceacbe", t="Where would you like to fly to?", d=1.480, v="goblin-male" },
	},
	[10618] = {
		{ f="10618-dc398343", h="dc398343", t="Hello, traveler. Not many find me out this way.$B$BMy name is Rivern, and I train the Winterspring Frostsabers to become mounts.$B$BThese cats are the most feral and difficult to subdue of all the sabers. Only the most trusted and exalted may attempt to ride one.$B$BI will not sell such a mount to just anyone; no, you must work for it and earn your acceptance not only with me, but with the sabers themselves.", d=31.061, v="nightelf-male-warrior" },
	},
	[10637] = {
		{ f="10637-4a9814c5", h="4a9814c5", t="It's a simple process for a craftsman of my caliber.$B$BThe most difficult aspect of crafting items out of beast hides and carapace is the actual acquisition of said parts. Now, if you could bring me a pristine hide from this beast, I could make several different powerful items from the flesh.", d=18.040, v="dwarf-male-grim" },
		{ f="10637-504d8fa6", h="504d8fa6", t="If you actually brought me the hide of the beast? Well... Let me show you...", d=4.880, v="dwarf-male-grim" },
		{ f="10637-b6de3f00", h="b6de3f00", t="The Thorium Brotherhood does not waste time on ants. Be gone!", d=4.360, v="dwarf-male-grim" },
		{ f="10637-f73d4de9", h="f73d4de9", t="I reckon that the odds of obtaining such a piece would be a one in a million! A once in a lifetime skin! Even the most disciplined artisans of the craft would no doubt fail several hundred times in the process of skinning the beast before a pristine sample was recovered. ", d=16.960, v="dwarf-male-grim" },
	},
	[10666] = {
		{ f="10666-43217733", h="43217733", t="Us is busy with important things!", d=4.744, v="npc-10006" },
		{ f="10666-5f4181c7", h="5f4181c7", t="Oh yeah. Us gots it right here.", d=5.411, v="npc-10006" },
		{ f="10666-f346152a", h="f346152a", t="Oh yeah. Us gots $n right here.", d=6.300, v="npc-10006" },
	},
	[10667] = {
		{ f="10667-77465cf5", h="77465cf5", t="Hello there, $N.  I am known as Chronormu, but you may call me Chromie.  I am comfortable with such familiarity.$B$BNow - how did I know your name, you ask?  I am one of the bronze dragonflight, forever attuned to the ebb and flow of time.  You could say that we have met before.  To that end, we shall also meet again.$B$BI hope that my choice of visual demeanor does not disturb you; while I might be charged to be a sentry of sorrowful places, I choose not to drown in the sorrow of the locale.   ", d=32.350, v="gnome-female" },
		{ f="10667-d7ca2af4", h="d7ca2af4", t="Hello once again, $n.  I sense that the flow of time remains threatened by forces that are quite powerful indeed.  Your continued assistance is always welcomed by the bronze dragonflight.$B$BWhile the past is set in its ways, the future is always changing.  The decisions you make in the here and now help guide that change.", d=20.590, v="gnome-female" },
	},
	[10668] = {
		{ f="10668-19e45338", h="19e45338", t="The body is that of a female orc warrior.  It is clear that she died in battle, probably against the quilboar in the area.", d=8.200, v="orc-female" },
		{ f="10668-36aec325", h="36aec325", t="You turn the body over and see the marks from blades and spells upon the deceased orc--her armor all but destroyed, her hair matted to her face.  Based on Mankrik's description of her, there is no doubt in your mind that this was his wife.  He will be upset by the news, but you are sure he should know the truth.", d=18.710, v="orc-female" },
		{ f="10668-8ac74c94", h="8ac74c94", t="The body is that of a female orc warrior.  It is clear that she died in battle, probably against the quilboar in the area.", d=6.840, v="orc-female" },
		{ f="10668-aa4f9f41", h="aa4f9f41", t="You turn the body over and see the marks from blades and spells upon the deceased orc--her armor all but destroyed, her hair matted to her face.  Based on Mankrik's description of her, there is no doubt in your mind that this was his wife.  He will be upset by the news, but you are sure he should know the truth.", d=20.110, v="orc-female" },
	},
	[10684] = {
		{ f="10684-51b18dbc", h="51b18dbc", t="Such sssorrow... The passst cannot be undone...", d=4.408, v="banshee-female" },
		{ f="10684-bec13286", h="bec13286", t="I will not forrrget what you have done...$B$BPleassse, leave meee...", d=6.816, v="banshee-female" },
	},
	[10721] = {
		{ f="10721-529f8cda", h="529f8cda", t="<Novice $C gulps.>    I can do this.", d=1.720, v="scourge-male", s={ ["f"]=2.840 }, P={ { d=2.120, n=true }, { d=1.360 } }, nP={ [1]={ [1]=2.400 } } },
		{ f="10721-738b752e", h="738b752e", t="Are you here to prove yourself as well?", d=2.680, v="scourge-male", s={ ["f"]=4.080 } },
		{ f="10721-940ee1b1", h="940ee1b1", t="I am ready.", d=1.680, v="scourge-male", s={ ["f"]=2.480 } },
		{ f="10721-a05588c0", h="a05588c0", t="<Novice Warrior gulps.>    I can do this.", d=1.440, v="scourge-male", s={ ["f"]=4.320 }, P={ { d=1.640, n=true }, { d=1.960 } }, nP={ [1]={ [1]=2.360 } } },
		{ f="10721-f8389317", h="f8389317", t="Are you ready to begin?", d=1.760, v="scourge-male", s={ ["f"]=2.720 } },
	},
	[10739] = {
		{ f="10739-113c02eb", h="113c02eb", t="\"...\"$B$BThe body of the tauren druid lies still and unmoving.  It would seem as though he has finally passed from this world to his promised great beyond.", d=14.000, v="tauren-male" },
		{ f="10739-589ca318", h="589ca318", t="Please, help me $g brother : sister;...$B$BI will soon pass from this world, and though I suffer I know I shall not any more once I pass.  The wildlife though, my $g brother : sister;... the wildlife suffers too, and it knows no release.  I ask for your aid with my last breaths of life.", d=21.760, v="tauren-male", g=true },
		{ f="10739-b71e2f40", h="b71e2f40", t="Yes, I speak a language you understand $r.  We are not animals, yet most of your kind continues to treat us as such!  Our differences though pale to the tragedy that has befallen this land.  Please, put aside your differences with my kind and hear my dying plea.$B$BI came to this land to mend what I could, and now that will be for naught unless you can aid me.  I ask for such aid with my last breaths of life.", d=35.390, v="tauren-male" },
	},
	[10740] = {
		{ f="10740-3ab3f742", h="3ab3f742", t="I... I am badly injured... ", d=2.280, v="narrator", n={ [1]=3.280 } },
		{ f="10740-469bfdaf", h="469bfdaf", t="Nefarian had ordered that unsuitable subjects be destroyed immediately, but these retched beasts would not do so without first inflicting an 'ample' amount of torture.$B$BWhen we were thoroughly 'broken,' they would round up what remained and throw us to these thugs. Our bodies used as instruments in their sick game: thrown into the lava or worse; to the open and waiting arms of the bloodthirsty legion below.", d=26.430, v="narrator", n={ [1]=28.870 } },
		{ f="10740-558435de", h="558435de", t="Listen, $r. Listen well...$B$BThe dragon riders came in the night, mounted atop the black flight. They struck fast and with deadly precision, taking young whelps - such as me - and escaping under the veil of darkness.$B$BI watched in horror as they used my brothers and sisters in their experiments. From our essence would be created the chromatic flight.", d=22.470, v="narrator", n={ [1]=23.630 } },
		{ f="10740-fe56ecec", h="fe56ecec", t="You came along just as they were about to throw me to the fiends below - for that, I thank you. Perhaps, I - rather - we, of the blue flight, can assist you further?$B$BYou have come this far, $r, risked much. Will you go a ways further to battle Nefarian and his legion of Blackrock? ", d=19.760, v="narrator", n={ [1]=20.040 } },
	},
	[10776] = {
		{ f="10776-2016021f", h="2016021f", t="Well, maybe 'pay' isn't the best word to use. See, when I was stuck in the belly of that thing, I got to thinking:$B$BThis creature lives in hot, flaming magma and yet it doesn't take a lick of damage from the fire!$B$BIf only I could find a pristine hide from one of these beasts. I could take it back to my dear friend, Malyfous Darkhammer, in Everlook. If anyone could do anything with the hide of a beast like this, it would be him.  ", d=18.634, v="gnome-male-zany" },
		{ f="10776-515d8abd", h="515d8abd", t="Alrighty then! So I was down at the lava pits of the Molten Span, testing out my lava suit. Everything was going great. I was even able to swim around in that stuff without suffering a single injury!$B$BSo there I am, minding my own business, doing a few backstrokes, when out of nowhere this thing swallows me up whole! Had it not been for my lava suit and built in food pellet dispenser, I would have been done for!", d=19.437, v="gnome-male-zany" },
		{ f="10776-a23c5b89", h="a23c5b89", t="I'm not out of the belly of this beast for more than two minutes and someone is already asking me about my bathroom behavior??? $G Mister:Missy;, I'd have smacked you silly for that question had you not been the one to rescue me!$B$BAnyhow! I'm grateful for the assistance. Maybe I can pay you back?", d=12.772, v="gnome-male-zany", g=true },
		{ f="10776-b44db489", h="b44db489", t="How?? Well, it's a long story.", d=2.901, v="gnome-male-zany" },
		{ f="10776-d00048d4", h="d00048d4", t="Say, I sense a measure of disbelief in your voice - but yes, that's how it happened.", d=4.611, v="gnome-male-zany" },
		{ f="10776-d8b7991b", h="d8b7991b", t="Whew... I need a smoke and the touch of a fine gnomish woman - not particularly in that order!$B$BI've been stuck inside the belly of that thing for months! What day is it anyway? Ah, nevermind. All that matters is that I'm finally out.$B$BWOOO HOOO!", d=11.075, v="gnome-male-zany" },
		{ f="10776-fc7ce5f7", h="fc7ce5f7", t="So how about you deliver a message for me?", d=2.575, v="gnome-male-zany" },
	},
	[10778] = {
		{ f="10778-08a5494e", h="08a5494e", t="The spirit looks upon you with a sense of completeness and cognizance that had not been present before.$B$B\"I feel as though a great burden has been lifted from my soul.  Soon I will rest forever in peace.  I now know this, and I await this time patiently.$B$BThank you, stranger.\"", d=15.028, v="human-female" },
		{ f="10778-691588eb", h="691588eb", t="Shhh... do you smell something?", d=1.749, v="human-female" },
		{ f="10778-7017f047", h="7017f047", t="John, honey, where are you?", d=2.044, v="human-female" },
		{ f="10778-d9aa30af", h="d9aa30af", t="I have so much to do... so much before the plague comes... ", d=3.682, v="human-female" },
		{ f="10778-e444a08a", h="e444a08a", t="Time is running out for me... for us all...", d=2.381, v="human-female" },
		{ f="10778-fc1796a6", h="fc1796a6", t="What is happening to everyone?  I feel... cold...", d=3.728, v="human-female" },
	},
	[10781] = {
		{ f="10781-cb1093ae", h="cb1093ae", t="I am an officer of the city, working in the capacity of the Undercity's census.  Since our liberation from the Scourge, we have tried to keep an accurate track of our city's populace.  Through arcane methods and sharpened mental discipline, I am able to access these records.  If you have business with me accordingly, please proceed.  You should know if you do, at any rate.", d=26.150, v="scourge-male-dark" },
	},
	[10782] = {
		{ f="10782-3ab7bddd", h="3ab7bddd", t="Welcome to Stormwind!  I am one of the city's officers, aiding the citizenry of the city through our census bureau.  If you are in need of locating someone specific, then I might be able to assist you.  Through arcane methods and sharpened mental discipline, I am able to access these records.$B$BIf you have business with me, then please proceed!", d=24.692, v="human-male-standard" },
	},
	[10837] = {
		{ f="10837-0aa55eb6", h="0aa55eb6", t="Welcome to the front lines, $c.  While politicians may connive and scheme amongst themselves, they'll find no such luxury afforded to them here.  This is the Bulwark, and we fight for our continued survival on a daily basis here.$B$BIf you've come here looking for a chance to prove yourself as a hero, then you'll find plenty of opportunities to do so... especially as we push towards Andorhal and whatever malign force that controls the Scourge there.", d=32.070, v="scourge-male-warrior" },
	},
	[10838] = {
		{ f="10838-d00f7f88", h="d00f7f88", t="Welcome to the front lines, $c.  The Kingdom of Stormwind, with the aid of its allies, has sent me here to counter the growing threat of the Scourge.  Here at Chillwind Point, we fight for our continued survival on a daily basis.$B$BIf you've come here looking for a chance to prove yourself as a hero, then you'll find plenty of opportunities to do so... especially as we push towards Andorhal and whatever malign force that controls the Scourge there.", d=29.808, v="human-male-warrior" },
	},
	[10839] = {
		{ f="10839-4d3a3879", h="4d3a3879", t="Well met, friend.  I am Officer Garush, and I am a proud member of a world-wide organization known as the Argent Dawn.  Our cause is to fight swiftly and mercilessly against any element of evil that surfaces in Azeroth.  We are not a political body, nor do we ever wish to become one.  Our cause is singular, and to that end we call both the Horde and Alliance as friends - friends in the cause of stamping out evil!$B$BFor the Dawn, my $g brother : sister;!", d=38.550, v="orc-male-guard", g=true },
	},
	[10840] = {
		{ f="10840-bc594dcd", h="bc594dcd", t="Well met, friend.  I am Officer Pureheart, and I am a proud member of a world-wide organization known as the Argent Dawn.  Our cause is simple - fight swifty and mercilessly against any element of evil that surfaces in Azeroth.  We are not a political body, nor do we ever wish to become one.  To that end we call both the Alliance and the Horde both as friends - friends in the cause of stamping out evil!$B$BFor the Dawn, my $g brother : sister;!", d=27.150, v="human-female-warrior", g=true },
	},
	[10856] = {
		{ f="10856-06322158", h="06322158", t="The Argent Dawn salutes you, $c.  I am Hasana - one of but a few authorized equipment and materiel quartermasters for the Dawn.$B$BAs you fight evil under our commission - all the while earning our respect and trust - you'll earn valor tokens from Officer Garush.  Tokens serve two purposes: use them to gain increased standing within our ranks, or use them as tender in acquiring special items.$B$BAs you improve your standing with the Dawn, you'll discover that more items will be made available to you.", d=38.439, v="troll-female-old" },
	},
	[10857] = {
		{ f="10857-6469fb89", h="6469fb89", t="The Argent Dawn salutes you, $c!  The name's Lightspark, and I'm an authorized equipment and materiel quartermaster for the Dawn.$B$BAs you fight evil under our commission - all the while earning our respect and trust - you'll earn valor tokens from Officer Pureheart.  Tokens serve two purposes: use them to gain increased standing within our ranks, or use them as tender in acquiring special items.$B$BAs you improve your standing with the Dawn, you'll discover that more items will be made available to you.", d=24.927, v="gnome-male-standard" },
	},
	[10877] = {
		{ f="10877-dc8290dc", h="dc8290dc", t="Greetings and salutations, hero!  I have the latest news from both continents and points beyond for your consideration.", d=8.880, v="dwarf-male-standard" },
	},
	[10878] = {
		{ f="10878-6c0228ac", h="6c0228ac", t="Your legacy precedes you, $c. If you wish, I can allow you to rewrite that legacy into something new.", d=10.061, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="10878-dc8290dc", h="dc8290dc", t="Greetings and salutations, hero!  I have the latest news from both continents and points beyond for your consideration.", d=9.899, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
	},
	[10879] = {
		{ f="10879-6c0228ac", h="6c0228ac", t="Your legacy precedes you, $c. If you wish, I can allow you to rewrite that legacy into something new.", d=8.960, v="scourge-male-standard" },
		{ f="10879-dc8290dc", h="dc8290dc", t="Greetings and salutations, hero!  I have the latest news from both continents and points beyond for your consideration.", d=10.120, v="scourge-male-standard" },
	},
	[10880] = {
		{ f="10880-6c0228ac", h="6c0228ac", t="Your legacy precedes you, $c. If you wish, I can allow you to rewrite that legacy into something new.", d=8.886, v="orc-male-standard" },
		{ f="10880-dc8290dc", h="dc8290dc", t="Greetings and salutations, hero!  I have the latest news from both continents and points beyond for your consideration.", d=10.118, v="orc-male-standard" },
	},
	[10881] = {
		{ f="10881-6c0228ac", h="6c0228ac", t="Your legacy precedes you, $c. If you wish, I can allow you to rewrite that legacy into something new.", d=7.033, v="tauren-male-warrior" },
		{ f="10881-dc8290dc", h="dc8290dc", t="Greetings and salutations, hero!  I have the latest news from both continents and points beyond for your consideration.", d=6.785, v="tauren-male-warrior" },
	},
	[10897] = {
		{ f="10897-c5ceacbe", h="c5ceacbe", t="Where would you like to fly to?", d=2.554, v="nightelf-female-sentinel" },
	},
	[10917] = {
		{ f="10917-7ca9481b", h="7ca9481b", t="Leave me.  My wounds are great and I fear they will overtake me.  Thank you, $n.  I will die here, but because of you... I'll die in peace.", d=11.838, v="human-male-warrior" },
		{ f="10917-ec3d1998", h="ec3d1998", t="I do not have much time in this world, but Light willing, it is time enough to fulfill my destiny.  When you face Baron Rivendare, I will be with you.", d=12.000, v="human-male-warrior" },
		{ f="10917-eea00363", h="eea00363", t="It is good to see others who fight the Scourge in Stratholme, for it is here they are strongest.$B$BGreetings.  I am Aurius.  I was once a paladin of the Silver Hand, but like others whose faith wavered... I fell from grace.  The Scourge seduced me and nearly transformed me into a death knight!$B$BFinally sensing my peril, I fled to this chapel.  It is a sacred place, where the first paladin, Uther the Lightbringer, was ordained into the order of the Silver Hand.", d=31.020, v="human-male-warrior" },
	},
	[10918] = {
		{ f="10918-52af94dd", h="52af94dd", t="I would teach him how to demon forge in exchange for his soul. The soul of a Blackrock orc is worth very little but in these trying times, a soul, any soul, is better than none at all.", d=15.760, v="satyr-male" },
		{ f="10918-61a162f2", h="61a162f2", t="You?$B$B<Lorax laughs.>$B$BThat is doubtful.$B$BI stand in these ruins and dream. Dream of the day that I catch that miserable thief, Goraluk Anvilcrack.$B$BWe had a deal, him and I. A deal that he broke. Betrayed.", d=17.560, v="satyr-male", P={ { d=2.160 }, { d=1.440, n=true }, { d=16.160 } }, nP={ [1]={ [2]=1.440 } } },
		{ f="10918-7e50d794", h="7e50d794", t="Test not my patience, mortal.", d=2.280, v="satyr-male" },
		{ f="10918-7eb064f7", h="7eb064f7", t="What it is that I do, of course. I brood. I lament. I hate. I plot. When that cycle is complete, I brood again. What is it you want from me? I have much on my mind.", d=17.680, v="satyr-male" },
		{ f="10918-ac43d6a4", h="ac43d6a4", t="He took the unforged rune covered breastplate, used in the making of the demon forged breastplate and ran away without making payment. A fool, I am not, however... the unforged chest piece is useless without knowledge or the recipe to apply said knowledge.$B$BI wonder... does he sit safely in his city of Blackrock Spire and attempt to create the item from the raw material? I know he dare not leave! ", d=32.790, v="satyr-male" },
		{ f="10918-c47b1a94", h="c47b1a94", t="Bite your tongue, $r, lest I rip it from your skull case and use it as a horn warmer.", d=6.320, v="satyr-male" },
	},
	[10922] = {
		{ f="10922-069b9412", h="069b9412", t="I welcome you, $N. And the Emerald Circle welcomes you.$B$BHopefully together we can help rejuventate and protect this once-mighty forest. Many forces seek to destroy it from without... and within.$B$BDo not be persuaded by the power here--it will only corrupt you, like it has this entire land.", d=21.720, v="tauren-female-shaman" },
	},
	[10929] = {
		{ f="10929-5305c52a", h="5305c52a", t="What is it you ask of the Blue Flight?", d=3.080, v="bloodelf-female" },
	},
	[10930] = {
		{ f="10930-08830bac", h="08830bac", t="Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?", d=22.030, v="dwarf-male-grim" },
		{ f="10930-72040e11", h="72040e11", t="I kinnae help ye with trainin'. Ye should look fer a $c trainer.", d=4.560, v="dwarf-male-grim" },
		{ f="10930-a665cdb8", h="a665cdb8", t="Wot kin I do fer ye?", d=2.600, v="dwarf-male-grim" },
	},
	[10936] = {
		{ f="10936-b703353b", h="b703353b", t="A darkness had fallen over my eyes, but you tore me from my unholy reverie.  You saved me, $n.$B$BAnd now I beg you... to forgive me.", d=9.575, v="human-male" },
	},
	[10945] = {
		{ f="10945-cd93650f", h="cd93650f", t="The battle is over, and the people of Darrowshire are saved.$B$BThey are saved, $n, because of you.  You are truly a hero of Darrowshire.", d=9.649, v="human-male" },
	},
	[10993] = {
		{ f="10993-35482387", h="35482387", t="I'm afraid you're out of my league, friend! You should go see Nogg in Orgrimmar, he'll take you to the next level!", d=5.607, v="goblin-male-zany" },
		{ f="10993-394f8d74", h="394f8d74", t="I can't help ya'! You're ready to see someone who's been at it longer than I have! Let's see... you're an Alliance type, so you need to talk to Lilliam Sparkspindle in Stormwind.", d=9.177, v="goblin-male-zany" },
		{ f="10993-3b5fc6b4", h="3b5fc6b4", t="(Sniff, sniff) You smell that? Don't you just LOVE the smell of grease?", d=5.173, v="goblin-male-zany" },
		{ f="10993-76e6815c", h="76e6815c", t="Yeah, I'll show you a few things. We'll see how you do, maybe you'll surprise me!", d=4.443, v="goblin-male-zany" },
	},
	[11016] = {
		{ f="11016-30da4069", h="30da4069", t="So cold... and hungry.$B$BMy poor friend, I hope you've found peace. I can't stand to think about what they could have done to you.$B$BYou! You there! Please, you have to help me escape. One of them has a key, can you find it? I know they have it. If you get it, you can help me get out of here. Trey is probably already dead, but there's still time! Please, can you help me?", d=23.592, v="nightelf-female-sentinel" },
		{ f="11016-a9c6ae89", h="a9c6ae89", t="You've already done me a great service, $n. For that I thank you.$B$BThe least I can do now is tell you what brought me here: My long time friend Trey Lightforge and I came to Jaedenar to investigate the Shadow Council when they caught us unprepared. They took Trey deeper into Shadow Hold and put me in here after taking all of our equipment... I can still hear his screams from below, $n. They were... inhuman. I don't know what they've done to him, but they will pay for it. ", d=34.543, v="nightelf-female-sentinel" },
	},
	[11017] = {
		{ f="11017-788cf9fc", h="788cf9fc", t="Nice try, but you'll need some more experience before training with me! Back to the trenches! ", d=5.513, v="goblin-male-zany" },
		{ f="11017-8ad376c5", h="8ad376c5", t="Nice going! I knew I was right about you, no matter what those other people said. Ha! I'm kidding! Okay, on with your lessons...", d=7.807, v="goblin-male-zany" },
		{ f="11017-9044017f", h="9044017f", t="Sometimes I surprise even myself!", d=3.244, v="goblin-male-zany" },
		{ f="11017-b4eaeac1", h="b4eaeac1", t="I can't teach what I don't know! If only there was someone else who knew more than I do... wait, there is! Go see Buzzek Bracketswing in Gadgetzan!", d=9.408, v="goblin-male-zany" },
	},
	[11019] = {
		{ f="11019-b01379bc", h="b01379bc", t="Hello, $c. I am Jessir Moonbow. I have come from Darnassus seeking two friends who came looking for signs of the Shadow Council in Felwood.  It seems those vile creatures who claim responsibility for much of the orcish race's suffering seeks to regain some of its power.  My two friends went looking in Jaedenar to prove one way or the other what was happening.  I expected them to be here when I arrived, but now they are days late.", d=31.350, v="nightelf-female-sentinel" },
	},
	[11025] = {
		{ f="11025-8faa4e47", h="8faa4e47", t="I know a few things. You want me to show you?", d=4.437, v="orc-male-standard" },
		{ f="11025-a40c1827", h="a40c1827", t="I like to build stuff. Of course, I like to blow stuff up even more!", d=6.144, v="orc-male-standard" },
		{ f="11025-f03c89ad", h="f03c89ad", t="You know who can really show you some things? Nogg! You go find him in Orgrimmar.", d=8.437, v="orc-male-standard" },
	},
	[11026] = {
		{ f="11026-0161bb95", h="0161bb95", t="This kind of work isn't for the faint of heart. I have an uncle who lost a hand! Poor old Stumpy... anyway, if you're still interested I might be able to show you a few things.", d=7.540, v="gnome-female-nerdy" },
		{ f="11026-40d3ed3c", h="40d3ed3c", t="You need to start learning things that are beyond my expertise! Talk to Lilliam Sparkspindle in front of the tent there. He'll set you on the right course!", d=6.432, v="gnome-female-nerdy" },
		{ f="11026-766a64ec", h="766a64ec", t="Ah, what a beautiful day to blow something up!", d=2.088, v="gnome-female-nerdy" },
	},
	[11028] = {
		{ f="11028-aa37b039", h="aa37b039", t="Well... I hate to admit it, but my sister's the one you'll have to talk to if you want to continue training. I don't know as much as she does... yet! She's standing over by the rocket car.", d=11.412, v="gnome-female-happy" },
		{ f="11028-dd2021b3", h="dd2021b3", t="I'd love to teach you! Show my sister she's not the only one who knows a thing or two about engineering...", d=5.465, v="gnome-female-happy" },
		{ f="11028-ea44f66d", h="ea44f66d", t="I heard the new Henweigh 6000 will be rolling off the assembly line soon. I can barely contain my excitement!", d=6.782, v="gnome-female-happy" },
	},
	[11029] = {
		{ f="11029-28ea6aca", h="28ea6aca", t="You'll need to prove your worthiness before I go giving away my secrets! I've got just the test for you...", d=4.539, v="gnome-female-nerdy" },
		{ f="11029-58429543", h="58429543", t="Close, but no cigar! I'm afraid you'll have to talk to my sis, Jemma first. After she's gone over the basics with you, come see me and I'll show you the juicy stuff!", d=7.422, v="gnome-female-nerdy" },
		{ f="11029-afb5ab05", h="afb5ab05", t="Don't tell anyone else I said this, but even I don't know everything! If you want to keep learning, you should talk to the owner of the shop, Springspindle Fizzlegear.", d=7.205, v="gnome-female-nerdy" },
		{ f="11029-bbb4a5a5", h="bbb4a5a5", t="The plans for my twenty-foot tall turkey baster are nearly complete! Now all I need is a twenty-foot tall turkey...", d=5.332, v="gnome-female-nerdy" },
		{ f="11029-c82b1322", h="c82b1322", t="Not bad, for a beginner! I guess it couldn't hurt for me to show you a few things...", d=3.483, v="gnome-female-nerdy" },
	},
	[11031] = {
		{ f="11031-16aac61b", h="16aac61b", t="This is a waste of time, mine and yours! Go see Graham Van Talen if you want to begin your instruction! He's standing to my left over there.", d=10.280, v="scourge-male-dark" },
		{ f="11031-49404ac6", h="49404ac6", t="What do you think I could teach you? Roxxik would do a much better job. You can find him in Orgrimmar. Now be off!", d=10.120, v="scourge-male-dark" },
		{ f="11031-7fb84865", h="7fb84865", t="Let's see how competent you are, shall we? If you perform this task to my liking, I'll spend the time to teach you!", d=9.800, v="scourge-male-dark" },
		{ f="11031-826d285c", h="826d285c", t="I don't have time for idle gossip, I'm a professional!", d=4.120, v="scourge-male-dark" },
	},
	[11033] = {
		{ f="11033-f578efd7", h="f578efd7", t="I'm what you call a capitalist, $r.", d=2.800, v="dwarf-male-grim" },
	},
	[11035] = {
		{ f="11035-f9c2a49b", h="f9c2a49b", t="The Plaguelands are an excellent place to strike against the Scourge!", d=3.220, v="gnome-female-nerdy" },
	},
	[11037] = {
		{ f="11037-26cbec40", h="26cbec40", t="Oh, you've got oodles of things to learn still. I would teach you everything if I could, but I'm still learning too! Why don't you talk to Trixie Quickswitch in Ironforge, she'll help you further your education!", d=10.983, v="gnome-female-standard" },
		{ f="11037-4808f367", h="4808f367", t="Hello there! My name's Jenna! And you? ", d=2.820, v="gnome-female-standard" },
		{ f="11037-9d22a5b8", h="9d22a5b8", t="You want to train? With me? Fantastic! The only thing better than assembling bullets and explosive devices is to share that knowledge with someone else! Let's get started!", d=9.216, v="gnome-female-standard" },
	},
	[11038] = {
		{ f="11038-275cc2f4", h="275cc2f4", t="They hand the corpses to me, I toss them in the pit.", d=3.289, v="human-male-standard" },
	},
	[11040] = {
		{ f="11040-c50ede3b", h="c50ede3b", t="Have you seen Watcher Backus? So brave...$B$BI think he's the toughest of all the Night Watch. I wonder if he even notices I'm around....", d=9.720, v="human-female-official" },
	},
	[11041] = {
		{ f="11041-0ea3923d", h="0ea3923d", t="Is it not astonishing what one can create from the plants of the forest? Truly, Elune has blessed us with her bounty.", d=8.338, v="nightelf-female-sentinel" },
		{ f="11041-20fcaeac", h="20fcaeac", t="Elune-adore, my $gbrother:sister;. You are welcome here. Speak, and I will do what I can to aid you.", d=8.831, v="nightelf-female-sentinel", g=true },
		{ f="11041-711bbaa2", h="711bbaa2", t="You are kind to seek me out, but your skills are beyond my own. Have a word with Sylvanna Forestmoon, just over there. She's been looking for another student.", d=11.891, v="nightelf-female-sentinel" },
	},
	[11042] = {
		{ f="11042-04b4acc4", h="04b4acc4", t="Even slight alterations to a potion's ingredients can change it fundamentally. Patience and precision, young one: they will serve you well in all walks of life.", d=11.071, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11042-0c1cec21", h="0c1cec21", t="Ah, to be young again, and to have discovered potions for the first time. Thank you for refreshing my memory, $n. Now go share that youthful enthusiasm with Milla Fairancora over there.", d=15.192, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11042-6c2d4d54", h="6c2d4d54", t="I have learned much of potions over the long years, $n, and that knowledge is at your disposal. You have only to ask.", d=10.748, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11042-aa055e90", h="aa055e90", t="My skill at creating potions is inferior to yours. You are ready to speak with Ainethil, just over there. She will understand that you are ready for further instruction.", d=12.727, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
	},
	[11044] = {
		{ f="11044-0556ba58", h="0556ba58", t="Have you now? This certainly doesn't look like something I had asked for.    This potion is clearly inert, meaning it will no longer create reactions. Hence it is of no use to my studies.    Take it back to Alessandro. Perhaps next time he sends me a potion he can find someone with faster feet.    <Doctor Felben waves a dismissive hand.>", d=19.440, v="scourge-male-warrior", P={ { d=21.080 }, { d=2.720, n=true } }, nP={ [1]={ [2]=3.080 } } },
		{ f="11044-386a9ec7", h="386a9ec7", t="Once, it is true, I was human. What might otherwise be a shortcoming works to our advantage, $N, for I know human weaknesses intimately.", d=13.200, v="scourge-male-warrior" },
		{ f="11044-9dbf29bd", h="9dbf29bd", t="Very well. Cut another lump of flesh from one of these specimens. Let us test what you've learned so far, and we can progress from there.", d=7.680, v="scourge-male-warrior" },
		{ f="11044-eb81d9ad", h="eb81d9ad", t="Your knowledge of potions has exceeded mine, but you still have much to learn. Go up the stairs to the southeast and see Doctor Marsh. He will teach you true sufferi--ahem. He is a Forsaken who will train you further.", d=17.720, v="scourge-male-warrior" },
	},
	[11046] = {
		{ f="11046-28b8dee2", h="28b8dee2", t="Why should I pace myself if this is working?", d=6.120, v="orc-male-shady" },
		{ f="11046-6253ba70", h="6253ba70", t="All the bottles on this table are potions I brewed today. And they say a watched pot never boils. Ha!", d=8.280, v="orc-male-shady" },
		{ f="11046-90f63e56", h="90f63e56", t="Can't help you. You know more about potions than I do. Besides, I have pots to watch. Talk to Yelmak over there. He knows a lot about potions.", d=13.080, v="orc-male-shady" },
		{ f="11046-ecccd281", h="ecccd281", t="They called me stupid, but I'll show them. I'm going to watch every pot I have and prove that they can all boil stuff anyway. Yeah, I'm on a roll! Who's stupid now, huh? Huh!?", d=16.760, v="orc-male-shady" },
	},
	[11047] = {
		{ f="11047-7530984f", h="7530984f", t="Bena works like one possessed. Day and night I have seen her bent over these potions, often going without sleep or food. I know our undead allies need help, but I begin to fear she will do herself an injury.", d=16.560, v="tauren-male-elder" },
		{ f="11047-c719a0fa", h="c719a0fa", t="I must have broken hundreds of vials when I first began brewing potions. The glass was so fragile in my clumsy hands. I hope you are more cautious than I was.", d=14.080, v="tauren-male-elder" },
		{ f="11047-f018918d", h="f018918d", t="Your capacity for learning has outstripped mine. You will need to talk to Bena Winterhoof over there for further instruction. Please don't take too much of her time, though. She needs her rest.", d=13.560, v="tauren-male-elder" },
	},
	[11048] = {
		{ f="11048-2479a86b", h="2479a86b", t="Yes, I think you have potential. Maybe I can show you a thing or two.", d=6.600, v="scourge-male-warrior" },
		{ f="11048-f49c9bcc", h="f49c9bcc", t="I'm just a student myself, really. Rhiannon's the expert. She's standing by the crates over there. You can learn a lot from her.", d=9.320, v="scourge-male-warrior" },
		{ f="11048-fea86e4a", h="fea86e4a", t="We don't get many visitors out here. May I interest you in something?", d=6.440, v="scourge-male-warrior" },
	},
	[11049] = {
		{ f="11049-041039a1", h="041039a1", t="How can I share my secrets with a beginner? Try speaking with Victor Ward first.", d=6.680, v="scourge-female-standard" },
		{ f="11049-8b5e44c8", h="8b5e44c8", t="Good, you've got some grit! I like that. Well then, let's get going!", d=6.560, v="scourge-female-standard" },
		{ f="11049-8c8d14d6", h="8c8d14d6", t="Tailoring can come in very handy. I once had to sew my arm back on.", d=8.360, v="scourge-female-standard" },
		{ f="11049-e2d6563a", h="e2d6563a", t="You have worked your way up... time to see the boss. Go to Josef and tell him you are ready.", d=9.040, v="scourge-female-standard" },
	},
	[11050] = {
		{ f="11050-402e026a", h="402e026a", t="My education is ongoing, and your knowledge surpasses mine. If you wish to learn more you must speak to Me'lynn. She will guide you.", d=10.618, v="nightelf-female-sentinel" },
		{ f="11050-8b982bde", h="8b982bde", t="You will not be disappointed, traveler. Tailoring is a joyous endeavor.", d=5.382, v="nightelf-female-sentinel" },
		{ f="11050-e9e31cca", h="e9e31cca", t="There is no greater way to clear the mind than to weave.", d=4.842, v="nightelf-female-sentinel" },
	},
	[11051] = {
		{ f="11051-32f7eed3", h="32f7eed3", t="No part of the animals we hunt is wasted. ", d=3.520, v="tauren-male-shaman" },
		{ f="11051-48a55d04", h="48a55d04", t="With the Earth Mother's blessing, we shall begin.", d=3.600, v="tauren-male-shaman" },
		{ f="11051-af6fda37", h="af6fda37", t="You seek a higher knowledge. Tepa is blessed with such knowledge. She should be standing somewhere nearby...", d=7.440, v="tauren-male-shaman" },
	},
	[11052] = {
		{ f="11052-8d1eb638", h="8d1eb638", t="I have outfitted kings. With the proper training, you can too.", d=4.846, v="human-male-official" },
	},
	[11053] = {
		{ f="11053-1dddec17", h="1dddec17", t="The Scourge's plague is almost to the turning point; a handful more cauldron subversions will push us over the top!  Be sure to do your part to help out!", d=10.120, v="human-female-official" },
		{ f="11053-1de5917c", h="1de5917c", t="With the cauldrons breeched, we are now able to introduce the counter agent into the environment.  This should give the scourge a taste of their own medicine, as it were!$B$BCheck with Alchemist Arbington on information regarding the reagents needed to use in the cauldrons.  I will be handling all information reports on how we are doing overall in turning the plague against the Scourge!", d=24.230, v="human-female-official" },
		{ f="11053-1fd3b410", h="1fd3b410", t="We are dominating the Scourge - the effects of the altered plague will affect them for at least another full day!  We need to stay on top of it though, so be sure to sabotage a cauldron when you can.", d=12.520, v="human-female-official" },
		{ f="11053-78a364c6", h="78a364c6", t="The time has come, my $g brother : sister; in arms, to take back the night from the Scourge!", d=6.480, v="human-female-official", g=true },
		{ f="11053-7a7c64af", h="7a7c64af", t="We have begun to turn the Scourge's plague against them, but our hold is tenuous at best!  Be sure to aid the cause by subverting their cauldrons!", d=10.680, v="human-female-official" },
		{ f="11053-8e15022c", h="8e15022c", t="The Scourge's plague still dominates the zone, and we have a long way to go before the plague will be altered enough to affect them.  Collect the necessary resources and help out the war effort!", d=11.760, v="human-female-official" },
	},
	[11055] = {
		{ f="11055-1dddec17", h="1dddec17", t="The Scourge's plague is almost to the turning point; a handful more cauldron subversions will push us over the top!  Be sure to do your part to help out!", d=11.600, v="scourge-female-magic" },
		{ f="11055-1fd3b410", h="1fd3b410", t="We are dominating the Scourge - the effects of the altered plague will affect them for at least another full day!  We need to stay on top of it though, so be sure to sabotage a cauldron when you can.", d=12.960, v="scourge-female-magic" },
		{ f="11055-77143381", h="77143381", t="With the cauldrons breeched, we are now able to introduce the counter agent into the environment.  This should give the scourge a taste of their own medicine, as it were!$B$BCheck with Apothecary Dithers on information regarding the reagents needed to use in the cauldrons.  I will be handling all information reports on how we are doing overall in turning the plague against the Scourge!", d=29.030, v="scourge-female-magic" },
		{ f="11055-78a364c6", h="78a364c6", t="The time has come, my $g brother : sister; in arms, to take back the night from the Scourge!", d=7.680, v="scourge-female-magic", g=true },
		{ f="11055-7a7c64af", h="7a7c64af", t="We have begun to turn the Scourge's plague against them, but our hold is tenuous at best!  Be sure to aid the cause by subverting their cauldrons!", d=11.600, v="scourge-female-magic" },
		{ f="11055-8e15022c", h="8e15022c", t="The Scourge's plague still dominates the zone, and we have a long way to go before the plague will be altered enough to affect them.  Collect the necessary resources and help out the war effort!", d=13.680, v="scourge-female-magic" },
	},
	[11056] = {
		{ f="11056-15e427e2", h="15e427e2", t="This job is definitely not worth sixteen-five a year.", d=3.988, v="human-male-standard" },
		{ f="11056-2b55aedc", h="2b55aedc", t="Based on the sample of the toxin you provided for us, we think you will need the following: an arcane quickener, five somatic intensifiers, and and four pieces of runecloth.  With the vitreous focuser in tow, acquire the intensifiers from zombie or ghoul undead here in the Plaguelands!$B$BOnce you have these items, you should be able to load the counter agent into that cauldron.", d=24.762, v="human-male-standard" },
		{ f="11056-39a52239", h="39a52239", t="Based on the sample of the toxin you provided for us, we think you will need the following: an arcane quickener, six osseous agitators, and four pieces of runecloth.  With the vitreous focuser in tow, acquire the agitators from skeletal undead here in the Plaguelands!$B$BOnce you have these items, you should be able to load the counter agent into that cauldron.", d=23.638, v="human-male-standard" },
		{ f="11056-49f3ca48", h="49f3ca48", t="Well now $n, let's get to work on those cauldrons!  If you're going to collect the components we need, then get a vitreous focuser from me.  You'll need to have it on you to identify the necessary resources found on the Scourge that will turn those cauldrons.$B$BYou'll also need a dose of arcane quickener for the cauldrons.  It's not cheap, nor is it stable.  Once you have it, you'll only have thirty minutes to use it before it expires on you; be smart about buying it.", d=32.030, v="human-male-standard" },
		{ f="11056-8989b1df", h="8989b1df", t="Based on the sample of the toxin you provided for us, we think you will need the following: an arcane quickener, four ectoplasmic resonators, and four pieces of runecloth.  With the vitreous focuser in tow, acquire the resonators from wraith and ghostly undead here in the Plaguelands!$B$BOnce you have these items, you should be able to load the counter agent into that cauldron.", d=25.373, v="human-male-standard" },
	},
	[11057] = {
		{ f="11057-2b55aedc", h="2b55aedc", t="Based on the sample of the toxin you provided for us, we think you will need the following: an arcane quickener, five somatic intensifiers, and and four pieces of runecloth.  With the vitreous focuser in tow, acquire the intensifiers from zombie or ghoul undead here in the Plaguelands!$B$BOnce you have these items, you should be able to load the counter agent into that cauldron.", d=23.710, v="scourge-male-dark" },
		{ f="11057-39a52239", h="39a52239", t="Based on the sample of the toxin you provided for us, we think you will need the following: an arcane quickener, six osseous agitators, and four pieces of runecloth.  With the vitreous focuser in tow, acquire the agitators from skeletal undead here in the Plaguelands!$B$BOnce you have these items, you should be able to load the counter agent into that cauldron.", d=19.590, v="scourge-male-dark" },
		{ f="11057-49f3ca48", h="49f3ca48", t="Well now $n, let's get to work on those cauldrons!  If you're going to collect the components we need, then get a vitreous focuser from me.  You'll need to have it on you to identify the necessary resources found on the Scourge that will turn those cauldrons.$B$BYou'll also need a dose of arcane quickener for the cauldrons.  It's not cheap, nor is it stable.  Once you have it, you'll only have thirty minutes to use it before it expires on you; be smart about buying it.", d=32.670, v="scourge-male-dark" },
		{ f="11057-58398b91", h="58398b91", t="A fierce wind is coming - I can tell by the ache in my exposed knee.  I just hope we don't get caught up in it.", d=9.240, v="scourge-male-dark" },
		{ f="11057-8989b1df", h="8989b1df", t="Based on the sample of the toxin you provided for us, we think you will need the following: an arcane quickener, four ectoplasmic resonators, and four pieces of runecloth.  With the vitreous focuser in tow, acquire the resonators from wraith and ghostly undead here in the Plaguelands!$B$BOnce you have these items, you should be able to load the counter agent into that cauldron.", d=28.230, v="scourge-male-dark" },
	},
	[11063] = {
		{ f="11063-7646b1d1", h="7646b1d1", t="We have all been witness to terrible tragedies, but we must not let them drag us to despair.$B$BInstead, hold those memories close so that one day, we might find a reckoning.", d=12.081, v="human-male-warrior" },
	},
	[11064] = {
		{ f="11064-03b8ddfc", h="03b8ddfc", t="Thank you!  The battle for Darrowshire doomed me, but you have set me free!", d=5.674, v="human-male", s={ ["f"]=5.252 } },
		{ f="11064-15dbf199", h="15dbf199", t="Ah!  Please, if you see a survivor of Darrowshire, tell them I am free!", d=5.978, v="human-male", s={ ["f"]=5.350 } },
		{ f="11064-48b5fb4d", h="48b5fb4d", t="Thank you!  You freed me!", d=2.233, v="human-male", s={ ["f"]=2.008 } },
		{ f="11064-5d408695", h="5d408695", t="At last, my soul is free!", d=2.294, v="human-male", s={ ["f"]=2.805 } },
		{ f="11064-ff1a6b0d", h="ff1a6b0d", t="Oh, thank you!  I have been trapped in this nightmare for so long...", d=4.701, v="human-male", s={ ["f"]=4.083 } },
	},
	[11065] = {
		{ f="11065-03886821", h="03886821", t="Ah, ye're an inquisitive one, are ye'? Excellent! Pay close attention, this just might save yer skin when the goin' gets rough!", d=8.440, v="dwarf-male-standard" },
		{ f="11065-9c1c73ea", h="9c1c73ea", t="There are ways to strengthen steel beyond the hammer and forge, young wanderer. Care to learn more?", d=6.120, v="dwarf-male-standard" },
		{ f="11065-ad07ed45", h="ad07ed45", t="Ye're a fine enchanter indeed! Now it's time fer ye to move on. I want ye to talk to Gimble Thistlefuzz, upstairs. He's a bit of a character, but he'll steer ye in the right direction from here on out!", d=13.760, v="dwarf-male-standard" },
	},
	[11066] = {
		{ f="11066-01d948cc", h="01d948cc", t="Throm-ka! What you looking for, stranger?", d=3.903, v="orc-male-standard" },
		{ f="11066-b615098a", h="b615098a", t="To die in battle is glorious! But, with what I teach you, maybe you not die so quickly, hm?  ", d=8.399, v="orc-male-standard" },
		{ f="11066-f7f14434", h="f7f14434", t="You come to wrong place. Talk to the expert Godan over there. You learn more from him.", d=7.061, v="orc-male-standard" },
	},
	[11067] = {
		{ f="11067-28cbb649", h="28cbb649", t="Eh, well you've made it this far... go see Lavinia Crowe by the other bookshelf there. If you don't mess things up with her, maybe you can learn some more.", d=11.240, v="scourge-male-dark" },
		{ f="11067-d5b4ed51", h="d5b4ed51", t="I do not have time to waste, stranger. State your business or be off!", d=5.920, v="scourge-male-dark" },
		{ f="11067-e8016bc8", h="e8016bc8", t="You don't look like much to me, but who knows, maybe there's an enchanter hidden in there somewhere!", d=5.680, v="scourge-male-dark" },
	},
	[11068] = {
		{ f="11068-327fd53e", h="327fd53e", t="I'm afraid I have nothing to teach to someone with your experience. But you haven't reached the end of the road yet. Speak to Lucan Cordell, behind the counter there. He'll guide you through the next phase of your journey.", d=12.320, v="human-female-official" },
		{ f="11068-bf2f71d7", h="bf2f71d7", t="Hail, traveler! What brings you to my doorstep?", d=3.760, v="human-female-official" },
		{ f="11068-fe5ba491", h="fe5ba491", t="Hmm... well you seem capable enough. If you truly desire to learn, then nothing will stand in your way! I will guide you through your first steps on what I hope will be a long and fulfilling path.", d=11.600, v="human-female-official" },
	},
	[11070] = {
		{ f="11070-0809aae8", h="0809aae8", t="The Goddess has granted me wisdom, stranger. If it is her will, I shall pass it on to you.", d=7.232, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11070-c463fc25", h="c463fc25", t="Your skills are beyond my reach. It is time for you to face new challenges. Taladan will help you prepare. He is standing by the table there.", d=10.141, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11070-d1188d03", h="d1188d03", t="I will teach you what I can. Each lesson is a gift from the Goddess herself. Use her gifts wisely, and you shall not falter.", d=11.596, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
	},
	[11071] = {
		{ f="11071-9e99182c", h="9e99182c", t="I cannot teach you anything you don't already know. However, the knowledge of my father far surpasses my own. Go inside and speak to him. Good luck!", d=11.640, v="tauren-male-elder" },
		{ f="11071-ca2a6ee8", h="ca2a6ee8", t="There are many secrets that may be unlocked with patience and determination. Now, let us begin...", d=9.480, v="tauren-male-elder" },
		{ f="11071-f5e60885", h="f5e60885", t="What I wouldn't give to be out on the open plains on a day like this... but, my duty binds me.", d=7.680, v="tauren-male-elder" },
	},
	[11072] = {
		{ f="11072-15d6b2ff", h="15d6b2ff", t="Your skills are truly becoming extraordinary. Now, let us continue your training...", d=6.000, v="human-female-official" },
		{ f="11072-89c37a9a", h="89c37a9a", t="You have nearly reached the pinnacle of your training. To become the greatest enchanter you can possibly be, you have one more instructor to seek out. Her name is Annora, and you may find her in Uldaman.", d=13.640, v="human-female-official" },
		{ f="11072-d52c209e", h="d52c209e", t="You are eager, that is good. However, you are not yet ready to train with the likes of me. ", d=6.920, v="human-female-official" },
		{ f="11072-e23ef030", h="e23ef030", t="What brings you to the Tower?", d=2.240, v="human-female-official" },
	},
	[11074] = {
		{ f="11074-1dbd1097", h="1dbd1097", t="Train hard, train every day. And when you have perfected your skills, return to me.", d=8.480, v="orc-male-shady" },
		{ f="11074-650fd33a", h="650fd33a", t="You have reached new heights in your path to mastery. Let us see if we can take you even further...", d=8.800, v="orc-male-shady" },
		{ f="11074-ccedb517", h="ccedb517", t="There is only one whose skills exceed my own. You are ready to receive her knowledge. She is Annora, and you may find her... in Uldaman.", d=12.080, v="orc-male-shady" },
		{ f="11074-fcc0e349", h="fcc0e349", t="Have you come to seek the knowledge of Hgarth?", d=3.440, v="orc-male-shady" },
	},
	[11081] = {
		{ f="11081-0772f862", h="0772f862", t="In time you will be ready for what I have to teach, $n. Until then, please ask Darianna over there to help you with your training.", d=10.720, v="nightelf-male-standard" },
		{ f="11081-68d4b95d", h="68d4b95d", t="If you are here for further training, you have overestimated my abilities. Have a word with Telonis over there; he can help you.", d=10.040, v="nightelf-male-standard" },
		{ f="11081-befcceb5", h="befcceb5", t="Darianna shows promise, but she is so full of energy that it is hard for her to stay still and listen. With her strength and agility, I fear it won't be long before she is called to fight. We must teach her quickly.", d=15.160, v="nightelf-male-standard" },
		{ f="11081-cb7eee8e", h="cb7eee8e", t="Many animals lost their lives so that we could gain these materials. Do not take their sacrifice lightly, $N. Handle the leather with the respect it deserves.", d=10.720, v="nightelf-male-standard" },
	},
	[11083] = {
		{ f="11083-53d41aed", h="53d41aed", t="It's so exciting to be here in Darnassus, surrounded by talented people! I just know I'm going to make my family proud. Maybe if I'm really lucky, the Sentinels will ask me to join their forces on the front!", d=16.698, v="nightelf-female-sentinel" },
		{ f="11083-74fbc2b7", h="74fbc2b7", t="If you're interested in sewing with leather, you've certainly come to the right place. Faldron and Telonis are true artists, and I hope to learn much from them.", d=11.676, v="nightelf-female-sentinel" },
		{ f="11083-9dd7b921", h="9dd7b921", t="Oh, I'm sorry, but you know more about leather than I do at this point. Talk to Faldron over there if you wish to learn more.", d=7.789, v="nightelf-female-sentinel" },
	},
	[11084] = {
		{ f="11084-541681c4", h="541681c4", t="My axe has seen many battles, and I like to keep it handy. Enemy forces have fought their way into our capital several times now, but have no fear: we have always driven them back.", d=14.280, v="tauren-male-shaman" },
		{ f="11084-5b8544a6", h="5b8544a6", t="Your skills are insufficient to learn what I teach. Try talking to Mak over there instead. He can help you out until you're ready for more advanced lessons.", d=11.280, v="tauren-male-shaman" },
		{ f="11084-87a66ee0", h="87a66ee0", t="I cannot help you with further training: your skill at working with leather rivals my own. You should speak with Una, over there. I will vouch for your skill if need be.", d=12.520, v="tauren-male-shaman" },
		{ f="11084-b9560714", h="b9560714", t="I am pleased with your progress so far. Surely the Earth Mother has inspired your hands.", d=8.080, v="tauren-male-shaman" },
	},
	[11096] = {
		{ f="11096-455e2704", h="455e2704", t="This outfit really brings out the blue in my eyes, don't you think? It should be obvious I have plenty of skill to go around, so I can afford to share a few of my tricks of the trade. Listen up, okay?", d=10.248, v="human-male-official" },
		{ f="11096-904d1c22", h="904d1c22", t="There's nothing I can teach you, other than maybe a better eye for color and detail. Talk to Simon Tanner over there; he knows a lot of advanced techniques for working with leather.", d=9.236, v="human-male-official" },
		{ f="11096-ddec75b2", h="ddec75b2", t="I already know a lot about style. Now it's just a matter of mastering the techniques for working with leather. Good thing Simon's a real sport about helping me learn them.", d=8.989, v="human-male-official" },
	},
	[11097] = {
		{ f="11097-58e6431a", h="58e6431a", t="I'm not here to teach babes fresh out of the cradle. Ye've nowhere near the amount of skill I require in my students. In fact, ye're a sad figure of a $glad:lass;, an' I'll thank ye not to stand there jibber-jabberin' at me.", d=13.880, v="dwarf-male-guard", g=true },
		{ f="11097-5aa0cd68", h="5aa0cd68", t="I can make amazing things with the materials I find out here. By Muradin's beard, there are fantastic creatures in these hills! Go have a whack at them, $n, and bring me back some tall tales.", d=13.640, v="dwarf-male-guard" },
		{ f="11097-7d131d6d", h="7d131d6d", t="I love a good challenge; don't you? Aye, of course ye do. An' that's why you're about to do exactly what I say.", d=8.120, v="dwarf-male-guard" },
	},
	[11098] = {
		{ f="11098-0eb80609", h="0eb80609", t="All requests for my work must be made in person by the buyer. Orwin often asks me to reconsider, but my priorities lie here. Look around you: many of these fighters rely upon me for their armor.", d=14.879, v="tauren-female-official" },
		{ f="11098-10259ed3", h="10259ed3", t="You have wasted your time and mine by coming to me for training, $n. I have no time to teach basic skills. We're fighting a war here, and this is one of the front lines. Don't return to me until you are more prepared.", d=15.716, v="tauren-female-official" },
		{ f="11098-8ff62a4a", h="8ff62a4a", t="I only wish I had more students like you. Not many will venture so far into enemy territory. I salute your courage.", d=9.856, v="tauren-female-official" },
	},
	[11103] = {
		{ f="11103-03ca5480", h="03ca5480", t="Once the capital city of the Dark Iron dwarves, this volcanic labyrinth now serves as the seat of power for Ragnaros the Firelord. Ragnaros has uncovered the secret to creating life from stone and plans to build an army of unstoppable golems to aid him in conquering the whole of Blackrock Mountain. Obsessed with defeating Nefarian and his draconic minions, Ragnaros will go to any extreme to achieve final victory.   ", d=30.455, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-174473b0", h="174473b0", t="Recently, a night elf druid named Naralex discovered a network of underground caverns within the heart of the Barrens. Believing he could use the caverns' springs to restore lushness to the Barrens, the druid began siphoning the energies of the fabled Emerald Dream. His vision somehow became a nightmare, however, and soon the Wailing Caverns changed into a den of vicious, deadly predators. It is said that Naralex still resides somewhere inside the labyrinth, trapped beyond the edges of the Emerald Dream.  ", d=38.374, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-17e9d243", h="17e9d243", t="Uldaman is an ancient Titan vault that has laid buried within the earth since the world's creation. Dwarven excavations of the city have recently released the Titans' first failed creations: the troggs. Legends say that when the Titans deemed the trogg experiment a failure they tried again, resulting in the creation of the dwarven race. These secrets are recorded on the fabled Discs of Norgannon - massive artifacts that lie at the bottom of the ancient city, protected by giant constructs of living stone.  ", d=36.909, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-19490f29", h="19490f29", t="Maraudon is one of the most sacred sites within Desolace. The great temple/cavern is the burial place of Zaetar, one of two immortal sons born to the demigod, Cenarius. Legend holds that Zaetar and the earth elemental princess, Theradras, sired the misbegotten centaur race. It is said that upon their emergence, the barbaric centaur turned on their father and killed him. Some believe that Theradras, in her grief, trapped Zaetar's spirit within the winding cavern - used its energies for some malign purpose. ", d=36.475, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-19cbe7de", h="19cbe7de", t="When you give love tokens to townsfolk, you'll receive different gifts in return.  Some of those you'll want to keep and use, but others can be bundled together and given to your favorite hero!  Visit Kwee Q. Peddlefeet to turn them in.$B$BKwee can be found near Bolvar, Magni, or Tyrande.", d=21.495, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-1a6e2552", h="1a6e2552", t="This sun-blasted city is home to the Sandfury trolls, known for their particular ruthlessness and dark mysticism. Troll legends tell of a powerful sword called Sul'thraze the Lasher, a weapon capable of instilling fear and weakness in even the most formidable of foes. Long ago, the weapon was split in half. However, rumors have circulated that the two halves may be found somewhere within Zul'Farrak's walls. ", d=30.091, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-22aa3fe4", h="22aa3fe4", t="Razorfen Downs can be found on the very southern tip of the Barrens on the east side of the road.", d=6.748, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-2e88eda5", h="2e88eda5", t="Frustrated by the Dalaran wizards' lack of progress against the undead during the Third War, the Archmage Arugal elected to summon the extra-dimensional worgen to bolster his side's diminishing ranks. The wolf-men slaughtered the Scourge, then quickly turned on the wizards themselves and laid siege to the keep of the noble, Baron Silverlaine. The fort quickly fell into shadow and ruin. Driven mad with guilt, Arugal adopted the worgen as his children and retreated to the newly dubbed 'Shadowfang Keep'.  ", d=34.970, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-3141b27b", h="3141b27b", t="Crafted from the same vines as Razorfen Kraul, Razorfen Downs is the traditional capital city of the quilboar race. The sprawling, thorn-ridden labyrinth houses a veritable army of loyal quilboar as well as their high priests - the Death's Head tribe. Recently, however, a looming shadow has fallen over the crude den. Agents of the undead Scourge - led by the lich, Amnennar the Coldbringer - have taken control over the quilboar race and turned the maze of thorns into a bastion of undead might.   ", d=34.253, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-330cd2db", h="330cd2db", t="The mighty fortress carved within the fiery bowels of Blackrock Mountain was held by the sinister Dark Iron dwarves for centuries until Nefarian - the cunning son of the dragon, Deathwing - took control of the upper Spire and made war on the dwarves' holdings in the mountain's volcanic depths. Realizing that the dwarves were led by the mighty fire elemental, Ragnaros - Nefarian vowed to crush his enemies and claim the whole of Blackrock mountain for himself.  ", d=35.626, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-33439fd8", h="33439fd8", t="Over a thousand years ago a group of troll priests known as the Atal'ai attempted to bring back an ancient blood god named Hakkar the Soulflayer. After the resulting civil war the priests were defeated and exiled to the Swamp of Sorrows. There they erected a temple to Hakkar to prepare for his arrival into the physical world. The dragon Aspect Ysera soon learned of the Atal'ai's plans and smashed the temple beneath the marshes. To this day, the temple's ruins are guarded by the mighty green dragons. ", d=40.232, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-342c02c0", h="342c02c0", t="The Stockades are a high-security prison complex, hidden beneath the canal district of Stormwind city. Presided over by Warden Thelwater, the Stockades are home to petty crooks, political insurgents, murderers and a score of the most dangerous criminals in the land. Recently, a prisoner-led revolt has resulted in a state of pandemonium within the Stockades - where the guards have been driven out and the convicts roam free.  ", d=30.293, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-41276936", h="41276936", t="Your body looks worn and your spirit weary. Rest yourself beneath our roof and allow Elune to guide your dreams.", d=6.950, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-4a0923b3", h="4a0923b3", t="Are you interested in exploring one of these dungeons?", d=3.475, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-4a6950fb", h="4a6950fb", t="The ruins of Dire Maul stand in central Ferelas.", d=5.455, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-4f48ef1f", h="4f48ef1f", t="Situated along the Zoram Strand of Ashenvale, Blackfathom Deeps was once a glorious temple dedicated to the night elves' moon-goddess Elune. However, the great Sundering shattered the temple - sinking it beneath the waves of the Veiled Sea. There it remained untouched - until, drawn by its ancient power - the naga and satyr emerged to plumb its secrets. Legends hold that the ancient beast, Aku'mai, has taken up residence within the temple's ruins.  ", d=34.859, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-581034a1", h="581034a1", t="The Scholomance is housed in crypts beneath the Caer Darrow keep. Once owned by the noble Barov family, the keep fell to ruin after the Second War. As the wizard Kel'Thuzad enlisted followers for his Cult of the Damned, he often promised immortality for those who served his Lich King. The Barovs fell to his influence and donated their keep, but the cultists killed the family and turned the crypts into a school of necromancy. Though Kel'Thuzad no longer resides there, cultists and instructors still remain. ", d=35.828, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-5dc31760", h="5dc31760", t="During the War of the Ancients, the demigod Agamaggan came forth to battle the Burning Legion. The colossal boar was defeated, and over time in the areas where his blood fell, massive thorn-ridden vines sprouted to life. The quilboar came to occupy these regions and hold them sacred. The heart of these massive thorn-colonies is the Razorfen. Razorfen Kraul was conquered by the crone, Charlga Razorflank, who some speculate has been negotiating with agents of the Scourge for some insidious purpose. ", d=37.202, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-5eccd4fa", h="5eccd4fa", t="The Sunken Temple can be found in the center of a great lake in eastern Swamp of Sorrows.", d=6.950, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-5ff7a251", h="5ff7a251", t="Scarlet Monastery lies in the hills northeast of Tirisfal Glades.", d=5.899, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-66f64f6e", h="66f64f6e", t="Razorfen Kraul can be found on the very southern tip of the Barrens on the west side of the road.", d=7.677, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-69040db4", h="69040db4", t="Love tokens are small messages of affection you can give to amorous town and city folk.  Such people will reward you with a gift of adoration.$B$BOr, if you are already adored by another, then at the least they'll give you a gift of friendship.", d=18.303, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-6a089d41", h="6a089d41", t="The ruined city of Stratholme lies in the Eastern Plaguelands to the north of the Plaguewood.", d=6.909, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-70185dce", h="70185dce", t="Uldaman can be found at the very northern end of the Badlands.", d=4.444, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-7b1bcef4", h="7b1bcef4", t="The Deadmines can be found beneath Moonbrook in the south of Westfall.", d=4.404, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-7de88db1", h="7de88db1", t="Located in Dun Morogh, Gnomeregan has been the gnomes' capital city for generations, though it was recently infested by mutant troggs. In a desperate attempt to retaliate, High Tinker Mekkatorque ordered the emergency venting of the city's radioactive waste tanks. Though the troggs became irradiated, their siege continued unabated and the gnomes were forced to seek refuge in the dwarven city of Ironforge, where the High Tinker now enlists brave souls to help his people reclaim their beloved city.  ", d=35.869, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-864c5566", h="864c5566", t="The Wailing Caverns has its entrance at the Lushwater Oasis southwest of Crossroads in the Barrens.   ", d=7.071, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-95351c86", h="95351c86", t="Once the jewel of northern Lordaeron, the city of Stratholme is where Prince Arthas turned against his mentor, Uther Lightbringer, and slaughtered hundreds of his own subjects who were believed to have contracted the plague of undeath. Arthas' surrender to the Lich King soon followed. The broken city is now inhabited by the undead Scourge - led by the powerful lich, Kel'Thuzad, and a contingent of Scarlet Crusaders, led by Grand Crusader Dathrohan. The two sides are locked in constant, violent combat.  ", d=35.465, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-a9df0aa1", h="a9df0aa1", t="Blackfathom Deeps can be found at the north end of Zoram Strand along the coast of Ashenvale.", d=7.232, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-ab572ddf", h="ab572ddf", t="The monastery was once a center for learning and enlightenment. With the rise of the undead Scourge during the Third War, the peaceful Monastery was converted into a stronghold of the fanatical Scarlet Crusade. The Crusaders are intolerant of all non-human races, regardless of alliance or affiliation. They believe that any and all outsiders are potential carriers of the undead plague - and must be destroyed.  ", d=29.929, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-ad5ec0ca", h="ad5ec0ca", t="No, I'm not, but lots of others are looking for love.  You should buy my love tokens, put on some cologne or perfume, and then pass them around!", d=11.960, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-adc7501c", h="adc7501c", t="The School for Necromancy known as Scholomance is on the ruined island of Caer Darrow in the Western Plaguelands.", d=8.566, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-b69e98a5", h="b69e98a5", t="If you put on cologne or perfume, then you'll see who is amorous.  Those are the ones who accept love tokens... and offer a gift in return.$B$BBut remember: to give someone a love token, you have to smell just right!  Men like the scent of perfume, while women prefer cologne.", d=20.566, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-b852ea17", h="b852ea17", t="Ragefire Chasm consists of a network of volcanic caverns below the orcs' new capital city of Orgrimmar. Recently, rumors have spread that a cult loyal to the demonic Shadow Council has taken up residence within the Chasm's fiery depths. This cult, known as the Burning Blade, threatens the very sovereignty of Durotar. Many believe that the orc Warchief Thrall is aware of the Blade's existence and has chosen not to destroy it in the hopes that its members might lead him straight to the Shadow Council.  ", d=32.919, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-b8eefffb", h="b8eefffb", t="Shadowfang Keep is in southern Silverpine just north of Pyrewood Village.", d=6.869, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-b8ef9c65", h="b8ef9c65", t="The Stormwind Stockades are found near the mage quarter in Stormwind.", d=4.687, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-c2bfa0cf", h="c2bfa0cf", t="Gnomeregan can be found in western Dun Morogh.", d=3.758, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-ca5fde90", h="ca5fde90", t="Maraudon is located in the middle of the western coast of Desolace, in the Valley of Spears.", d=7.434, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-d352a290", h="d352a290", t="Once the greatest gold production center in the human lands, the Dead Mines are now inhabited by the Defias Brotherhood, who have turned the dark tunnels into their private sanctum. It is rumored that the thieves have conscripted the clever goblins to help them build something terrible at the bottom of the mines - but what that may be is still uncertain. Rumor has it that the way into the Deadmines lies through the quiet, unassuming village of Moonbrook. ", d=32.838, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-e99614f5", h="e99614f5", t="The ruins of Zul'Farrak are located in the northwestern corner of the Tanaris Desert.", d=8.323, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-f106f818", h="f106f818", t="Built twelve thousand years ago by a covert sect of night elf sorcerers, the ancient city of Eldre'Thalas was used to protect Queen Azshara's most prized arcane secrets. Though it was ravaged by the Great Sundering of the world, much of the wondrous city still stands as the imposing Dire Maul. The ruins' three distinct districts have been overrun by all manner of creatures - especially the spectral highborne, foul satyr and brutish ogres.  ", d=30.859, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-f2218c4a", h="f2218c4a", t="Blackrock Mountain lies between Searing Gorge in the north and Burning Steppes in the south.", d=8.162, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-f88f28f5", h="f88f28f5", t="Ragefire Chasm can be found beneath the Shadow Cleft in the center of Orgrimmar.", d=6.222, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
		{ f="11103-f9fa0d11", h="f9fa0d11", t="When you give love tokens to townsfolk, you'll receive different gifts in return.  Some of those you'll want to keep and use, but others can be bundled together and given to your favorite hero!  Visit Kwee Q. Peddlefeet to turn them in.$B$BKwee can be found near Cairne, Sylvanas and Thrall.", d=21.374, v="nightelf-female-standard" },
	},
	[11106] = {
		{ f="11106-03ca5480", h="03ca5480", t="Once the capital city of the Dark Iron dwarves, this volcanic labyrinth now serves as the seat of power for Ragnaros the Firelord. Ragnaros has uncovered the secret to creating life from stone and plans to build an army of unstoppable golems to aid him in conquering the whole of Blackrock Mountain. Obsessed with defeating Nefarian and his draconic minions, Ragnaros will go to any extreme to achieve final victory.   ", d=32.990, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-174473b0", h="174473b0", t="Recently, a night elf druid named Naralex discovered a network of underground caverns within the heart of the Barrens. Believing he could use the caverns' springs to restore lushness to the Barrens, the druid began siphoning the energies of the fabled Emerald Dream. His vision somehow became a nightmare, however, and soon the Wailing Caverns changed into a den of vicious, deadly predators. It is said that Naralex still resides somewhere inside the labyrinth, trapped beyond the edges of the Emerald Dream.  ", d=39.790, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-17e9d243", h="17e9d243", t="Uldaman is an ancient Titan vault that has laid buried within the earth since the world's creation. Dwarven excavations of the city have recently released the Titans' first failed creations: the troggs. Legends say that when the Titans deemed the trogg experiment a failure they tried again, resulting in the creation of the dwarven race. These secrets are recorded on the fabled Discs of Norgannon - massive artifacts that lie at the bottom of the ancient city, protected by giant constructs of living stone.  ", d=43.860, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-19490f29", h="19490f29", t="Maraudon is one of the most sacred sites within Desolace. The great temple/cavern is the burial place of Zaetar, one of two immortal sons born to the demigod, Cenarius. Legend holds that Zaetar and the earth elemental princess, Theradras, sired the misbegotten centaur race. It is said that upon their emergence, the barbaric centaur turned on their father and killed him. Some believe that Theradras, in her grief, trapped Zaetar's spirit within the winding cavern - used its energies for some malign purpose. ", d=45.230, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-19cbe7de", h="19cbe7de", t="When you give love tokens to townsfolk, you'll receive different gifts in return.  Some of those you'll want to keep and use, but others can be bundled together and given to your favorite hero!  Visit Kwee Q. Peddlefeet to turn them in.$B$BKwee can be found near Bolvar, Magni, or Tyrande.", d=20.880, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-1a6e2552", h="1a6e2552", t="This sun-blasted city is home to the Sandfury trolls, known for their particular ruthlessness and dark mysticism. Troll legends tell of a powerful sword called Sul'thraze the Lasher, a weapon capable of instilling fear and weakness in even the most formidable of foes. Long ago, the weapon was split in half. However, rumors have circulated that the two halves may be found somewhere within Zul'Farrak's walls. ", d=35.830, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-22aa3fe4", h="22aa3fe4", t="Razorfen Downs can be found on the very southern tip of the Barrens on the east side of the road.", d=8.040, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-2e88eda5", h="2e88eda5", t="Frustrated by the Dalaran wizards' lack of progress against the undead during the Third War, the Archmage Arugal elected to summon the extra-dimensional worgen to bolster his side's diminishing ranks. The wolf-men slaughtered the Scourge, then quickly turned on the wizards themselves and laid siege to the keep of the noble, Baron Silverlaine. The fort quickly fell into shadow and ruin. Driven mad with guilt, Arugal adopted the worgen as his children and retreated to the newly dubbed 'Shadowfang Keep'.  ", d=39.820, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-3141b27b", h="3141b27b", t="Crafted from the same vines as Razorfen Kraul, Razorfen Downs is the traditional capital city of the quilboar race. The sprawling, thorn-ridden labyrinth houses a veritable army of loyal quilboar as well as their high priests - the Death's Head tribe. Recently, however, a looming shadow has fallen over the crude den. Agents of the undead Scourge - led by the lich, Amnennar the Coldbringer - have taken control over the quilboar race and turned the maze of thorns into a bastion of undead might.   ", d=42.790, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-330cd2db", h="330cd2db", t="The mighty fortress carved within the fiery bowels of Blackrock Mountain was held by the sinister Dark Iron dwarves for centuries until Nefarian - the cunning son of the dragon, Deathwing - took control of the upper Spire and made war on the dwarves' holdings in the mountain's volcanic depths. Realizing that the dwarves were led by the mighty fire elemental, Ragnaros - Nefarian vowed to crush his enemies and claim the whole of Blackrock mountain for himself.  ", d=35.550, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-33439fd8", h="33439fd8", t="Over a thousand years ago a group of troll priests known as the Atal'ai attempted to bring back an ancient blood god named Hakkar the Soulflayer. After the resulting civil war the priests were defeated and exiled to the Swamp of Sorrows. There they erected a temple to Hakkar to prepare for his arrival into the physical world. The dragon Aspect Ysera soon learned of the Atal'ai's plans and smashed the temple beneath the marshes. To this day, the temple's ruins are guarded by the mighty green dragons. ", d=41.350, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-342c02c0", h="342c02c0", t="The Stockades are a high-security prison complex, hidden beneath the canal district of Stormwind city. Presided over by Warden Thelwater, the Stockades are home to petty crooks, political insurgents, murderers and a score of the most dangerous criminals in the land. Recently, a prisoner-led revolt has resulted in a state of pandemonium within the Stockades - where the guards have been driven out and the convicts roam free.  ", d=30.430, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-4a0923b3", h="4a0923b3", t="Are you interested in exploring one of these dungeons?", d=4.480, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-4a6950fb", h="4a6950fb", t="The ruins of Dire Maul stand in central Ferelas.", d=5.440, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-4f48ef1f", h="4f48ef1f", t="Situated along the Zoram Strand of Ashenvale, Blackfathom Deeps was once a glorious temple dedicated to the night elves' moon-goddess Elune. However, the great Sundering shattered the temple - sinking it beneath the waves of the Veiled Sea. There it remained untouched - until, drawn by its ancient power - the naga and satyr emerged to plumb its secrets. Legends hold that the ancient beast, Aku'mai, has taken up residence within the temple's ruins.  ", d=36.670, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-581034a1", h="581034a1", t="The Scholomance is housed in crypts beneath the Caer Darrow keep. Once owned by the noble Barov family, the keep fell to ruin after the Second War. As the wizard Kel'Thuzad enlisted followers for his Cult of the Damned, he often promised immortality for those who served his Lich King. The Barovs fell to his influence and donated their keep, but the cultists killed the family and turned the crypts into a school of necromancy. Though Kel'Thuzad no longer resides there, cultists and instructors still remain. ", d=37.510, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-5dc31760", h="5dc31760", t="During the War of the Ancients, the demigod Agamaggan came forth to battle the Burning Legion. The colossal boar was defeated, and over time in the areas where his blood fell, massive thorn-ridden vines sprouted to life. The quilboar came to occupy these regions and hold them sacred. The heart of these massive thorn-colonies is the Razorfen. Razorfen Kraul was conquered by the crone, Charlga Razorflank, who some speculate has been negotiating with agents of the Scourge for some insidious purpose. ", d=37.710, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-5eccd4fa", h="5eccd4fa", t="The Sunken Temple can be found in the center of a great lake in eastern Swamp of Sorrows.", d=8.040, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-5ff7a251", h="5ff7a251", t="Scarlet Monastery lies in the hills northeast of Tirisfal Glades.", d=6.800, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-66f64f6e", h="66f64f6e", t="Razorfen Kraul can be found on the very southern tip of the Barrens on the west side of the road.", d=7.040, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-69040db4", h="69040db4", t="Love tokens are small messages of affection you can give to amorous town and city folk.  Such people will reward you with a gift of adoration.$B$BOr, if you are already adored by another, then at the least they'll give you a gift of friendship.", d=18.840, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-6a089d41", h="6a089d41", t="The ruined city of Stratholme lies in the Eastern Plaguelands to the north of the Plaguewood.", d=7.160, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-70185dce", h="70185dce", t="Uldaman can be found at the very northern end of the Badlands.", d=6.000, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-7b1bcef4", h="7b1bcef4", t="The Deadmines can be found beneath Moonbrook in the south of Westfall.", d=5.440, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-7de88db1", h="7de88db1", t="Located in Dun Morogh, Gnomeregan has been the gnomes' capital city for generations, though it was recently infested by mutant troggs. In a desperate attempt to retaliate, High Tinker Mekkatorque ordered the emergency venting of the city's radioactive waste tanks. Though the troggs became irradiated, their siege continued unabated and the gnomes were forced to seek refuge in the dwarven city of Ironforge, where the High Tinker now enlists brave souls to help his people reclaim their beloved city.  ", d=38.070, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-864c5566", h="864c5566", t="The Wailing Caverns has its entrance at the Lushwater Oasis southwest of Crossroads in the Barrens.   ", d=8.440, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-95351c86", h="95351c86", t="Once the jewel of northern Lordaeron, the city of Stratholme is where Prince Arthas turned against his mentor, Uther Lightbringer, and slaughtered hundreds of his own subjects who were believed to have contracted the plague of undeath. Arthas' surrender to the Lich King soon followed. The broken city is now inhabited by the undead Scourge - led by the powerful lich, Kel'Thuzad, and a contingent of Scarlet Crusaders, led by Grand Crusader Dathrohan. The two sides are locked in constant, violent combat.  ", d=40.910, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-a9df0aa1", h="a9df0aa1", t="Blackfathom Deeps can be found at the north end of Zoram Strand along the coast of Ashenvale.", d=8.920, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-ab572ddf", h="ab572ddf", t="The monastery was once a center for learning and enlightenment. With the rise of the undead Scourge during the Third War, the peaceful Monastery was converted into a stronghold of the fanatical Scarlet Crusade. The Crusaders are intolerant of all non-human races, regardless of alliance or affiliation. They believe that any and all outsiders are potential carriers of the undead plague - and must be destroyed.  ", d=34.830, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-ad5ec0ca", h="ad5ec0ca", t="No, I'm not, but lots of others are looking for love.  You should buy my love tokens, put on some cologne or perfume, and then pass them around!", d=12.000, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-adc7501c", h="adc7501c", t="The School for Necromancy known as Scholomance is on the ruined island of Caer Darrow in the Western Plaguelands.", d=8.600, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-b69e98a5", h="b69e98a5", t="If you put on cologne or perfume, then you'll see who is amorous.  Those are the ones who accept love tokens... and offer a gift in return.$B$BBut remember: to give someone a love token, you have to smell just right!  Men like the scent of perfume, while women prefer cologne.", d=19.440, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-b852ea17", h="b852ea17", t="Ragefire Chasm consists of a network of volcanic caverns below the orcs' new capital city of Orgrimmar. Recently, rumors have spread that a cult loyal to the demonic Shadow Council has taken up residence within the Chasm's fiery depths. This cult, known as the Burning Blade, threatens the very sovereignty of Durotar. Many believe that the orc Warchief Thrall is aware of the Blade's existence and has chosen not to destroy it in the hopes that its members might lead him straight to the Shadow Council.  ", d=40.550, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-b8eefffb", h="b8eefffb", t="Shadowfang Keep is in southern Silverpine just north of Pyrewood Village.", d=5.920, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-b8ef9c65", h="b8ef9c65", t="The Stormwind Stockades are found near the mage quarter in Stormwind.", d=5.440, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-c2bfa0cf", h="c2bfa0cf", t="Gnomeregan can be found in western Dun Morogh.", d=4.440, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-ca5fde90", h="ca5fde90", t="Maraudon is located in the middle of the western coast of Desolace, in the Valley of Spears.", d=7.160, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-d352a290", h="d352a290", t="Once the greatest gold production center in the human lands, the Dead Mines are now inhabited by the Defias Brotherhood, who have turned the dark tunnels into their private sanctum. It is rumored that the thieves have conscripted the clever goblins to help them build something terrible at the bottom of the mines - but what that may be is still uncertain. Rumor has it that the way into the Deadmines lies through the quiet, unassuming village of Moonbrook. ", d=35.870, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-e013de07", h="e013de07", t="As the wind on the plains, you are always welcome here.", d=5.000, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-e99614f5", h="e99614f5", t="The ruins of Zul'Farrak are located in the northwestern corner of the Tanaris Desert.", d=8.120, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-f106f818", h="f106f818", t="Built twelve thousand years ago by a covert sect of night elf sorcerers, the ancient city of Eldre'Thalas was used to protect Queen Azshara's most prized arcane secrets. Though it was ravaged by the Great Sundering of the world, much of the wondrous city still stands as the imposing Dire Maul. The ruins' three distinct districts have been overrun by all manner of creatures - especially the spectral highborne, foul satyr and brutish ogres.  ", d=33.430, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-f2218c4a", h="f2218c4a", t="Blackrock Mountain lies between Searing Gorge in the north and Burning Steppes in the south.", d=7.840, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-f88f28f5", h="f88f28f5", t="Ragefire Chasm can be found beneath the Shadow Cleft in the center of Orgrimmar.", d=7.480, v="tauren-female-standard" },
		{ f="11106-f9fa0d11", h="f9fa0d11", t="When you give love tokens to townsfolk, you'll receive different gifts in return.  Some of those you'll want to keep and use, but others can be bundled together and given to your favorite hero!  Visit Kwee Q. Peddlefeet to turn them in.$B$BKwee can be found near Cairne, Sylvanas and Thrall.", d=22.080, v="tauren-female-standard" },
	},
	[11116] = {
		{ f="11116-03ca5480", h="03ca5480", t="Once the capital city of the Dark Iron dwarves, this volcanic labyrinth now serves as the seat of power for Ragnaros the Firelord. Ragnaros has uncovered the secret to creating life from stone and plans to build an army of unstoppable golems to aid him in conquering the whole of Blackrock Mountain. Obsessed with defeating Nefarian and his draconic minions, Ragnaros will go to any extreme to achieve final victory.   ", d=25.397, v="tauren-male-warrior" },
